(3295795, 460267, 51793, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what you are really trying to accomplish here. You picture is a little too blurry to see what it really is but maybe if it was a bit larger you could tell what is going on here. You can choose a picture up to 640 pixels so you might want to try that next time. Also you misspelled the word just. Good luck and keep it up. It takes a lot of practice to get to the top and I and still soooooo far away but my advice is from what I have learned. Good luck.<br/>-J</td>', 'I''m not sure what you are really trying to accomplish here. You picture is a little too blurry to see what it really is but maybe if it was a bit larger you could tell what is going on here. You can choose a picture up to 640 pixels so you might want to try that next time. Also you misspelled the word just. Good luck and keep it up. It takes a lot of practice to get to the top and I and still soooooo far away but my advice is from what I have learned. Good luck.-J', '2007-01-29 00:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
