(3296500, 460235, 6388, '<td valign="top">you know...I struggle with images like this.  one one hand I understand the emotion that goes with exposing yourself (pun intended) like this...it can be very humbling and equally terrifying to lay it out for all to see.<br/> <br/>on the other hand the extreme processing wouldn''t be acceptable in any other challenge that didn''t involve such a vulnerable subject.  Obvious haloing and posterization...blown out highlights, pixellated shadows...they all really detract from the image and take away from what could be an emotional and candid image.<br/> <br/>A real bitch to vote objectively on :)<br/> <br/>however...all that said, I''m going to overlook the technical deficiencies (for the most part) and give it a 6, because I empathize with the motivation to enter, and the fear of offering too much.<br/> <br/>No idea where the rambling came from.  gonna move on now :)<br/> <br/>good luck with the image.<br/> <br/>P</td>', 'you know...I struggle with images like this.  one one hand I understand the emotion that goes with exposing yourself (pun intended) like this...it can be very humbling and equally terrifying to lay it out for all to see. on the other hand the extreme processing wouldn''t be acceptable in any other challenge that didn''t involve such a vulnerable subject.  Obvious haloing and posterization...blown out highlights, pixellated shadows...they all really detract from the image and take away from what could be an emotional and candid image. A real bitch to vote objectively on :) however...all that said, I''m going to overlook the technical deficiencies (for the most part) and give it a 6, because I empathize with the motivation to enter, and the fear of offering too much. No idea where the rambling came from.  gonna move on now :) good luck with the image. P', '2007-01-29 01:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3296506, 460428, 60505, '<td valign="top">beautiful left side shape/textures/shadows but not adequately balanced on the right, except by distracting arm and ?nail? IMHO. I may have just sliced this photo down the middle, which would show the highlight down the line of thirds!.</td>', 'beautiful left side shape/textures/shadows but not adequately balanced on the right, except by distracting arm and ?nail? IMHO. I may have just sliced this photo down the middle, which would show the highlight down the line of thirds!.', '2007-01-29 01:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3296518, 459326, 18450, '<td valign="top">Beautiful old fashioned feel to this shot, I love the way the morning lighting shadows pattern the body. <br/> <br/>I think I''d like to see you less centered in the shot, more open space to maybe the right of your body.....and that left arm a little more relaxed. Good work!</td>', 'Beautiful old fashioned feel to this shot, I love the way the morning lighting shadows pattern the body.  I think I''d like to see you less centered in the shot, more open space to maybe the right of your body.....and that left arm a little more relaxed. Good work!', '2007-01-29 01:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3296519, 459429, 60505, '<td valign="top">simply beautiful. great composition. love how my eye is drawn to the lower left 1/3 intersection.</td>', 'simply beautiful. great composition. love how my eye is drawn to the lower left 1/3 intersection.', '2007-01-29 01:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3296523, 459332, 18450, '<td valign="top">Ouch!!! But, beautiful work....the colours, crop, composition and lighting are exquisite!</td>', 'Ouch!!! But, beautiful work....the colours, crop, composition and lighting are exquisite!', '2007-01-29 01:48:30.000000', NULL, 1);
