(3298170, 460476, 4564, '<td valign="top">Superb model. This is a classic case of a great model and setup, but with poor lighting and use of DOF.  Suggestions: use only one key light, very narrow (with grid) to create a mood on in the shot. Maybe add a second light, very dimmed, to backlight the hair.  Shoot with F4 to try and get the floor and part of the brick wall blurred to bring more attention to the model and bathtub.  Good luck!</td>', 'Superb model. This is a classic case of a great model and setup, but with poor lighting and use of DOF.  Suggestions: use only one key light, very narrow (with grid) to create a mood on in the shot. Maybe add a second light, very dimmed, to backlight the hair.  Shoot with F4 to try and get the floor and part of the brick wall blurred to bring more attention to the model and bathtub.  Good luck!', '2007-01-29 10:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
