(3298526, 459556, 47534, '<td valign="top">you have a unique subject here, but she looks more nervous / afraid than sad.  sorry, but that was my first reaction...<br/> <br/>still, you have worked to include objects AND leave some to the imagination, and i think that shows you gave this a lot of thought &amp; effort - keep it up!</td>', 'you have a unique subject here, but she looks more nervous / afraid than sad.  sorry, but that was my first reaction... still, you have worked to include objects AND leave some to the imagination, and i think that shows you gave this a lot of thought & effort - keep it up!', '2007-01-29 12:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3298528, 460339, 47534, '<td valign="top">very well done indeed... you have chosen a terrific subject, and the pose is flattering without being overbearing - congratulations!</td>', 'very well done indeed... you have chosen a terrific subject, and the pose is flattering without being overbearing - congratulations!', '2007-01-29 12:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3298530, 460380, 69368, '<td valign="top">nice composition, good lighting and naturally colors. - 7 -</td>', 'nice composition, good lighting and naturally colors. - 7 -', '2007-01-29 12:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3298532, 460380, 53316, '<td valign="top">Generally I do not mind visible ribs, having been very thin for a long time myself. Here I think because the ribcage is in the center of the shot, the pattern of shadows competes for attention.  Possibly light from a different angle, or angling the body would help?  Or really, just a different composition would probably do a lot, since it wouldn''t be in the center anymore.  But I do realize that would make your shot totally different, and I do like it.  (I should also add that I think the body is beautiful!  Very graceful and elegant.) <br/> <br/>Oh gosh, I just noticed the ring on the lemon on the left! How totally awesome!!<br/> <br/>I think you did a great job with lighting.  The dark areas of the body on the right and left blend into the negative space in a really cool way.  The colors are great. This is an image where it looks like the levels are a bit off but instead of that being a problem, it actually works very nicely.</td>', 'Generally I do not mind visible ribs, having been very thin for a long time myself. Here I think because the ribcage is in the center of the shot, the pattern of shadows competes for attention.  Possibly light from a different angle, or angling the body would help?  Or really, just a different composition would probably do a lot, since it wouldn''t be in the center anymore.  But I do realize that would make your shot totally different, and I do like it.  (I should also add that I think the body is beautiful!  Very graceful and elegant.)  Oh gosh, I just noticed the ring on the lemon on the left! How totally awesome!! I think you did a great job with lighting.  The dark areas of the body on the right and left blend into the negative space in a really cool way.  The colors are great. This is an image where it looks like the levels are a bit off but instead of that being a problem, it actually works very nicely.', '2007-01-29 12:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3298533, 460420, 47534, '<td valign="top">you are right - this does convey elegance.  great focus, and including the mystery of part of your subject''s face is a great touch!</td>', 'you are right - this does convey elegance.  great focus, and including the mystery of part of your subject''s face is a great touch!', '2007-01-29 12:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
