(3299390, 460215, 50641, '<td valign="top">Brilliant visual pun.  I love how fake this looks.  Only thing that bugs me is the faint halo of some kind of editing near the bottom and the darker line drawn around the legs.  Some layer blending or smudging might make this less obvious.  It''s great anyway.</td>', 'Brilliant visual pun.  I love how fake this looks.  Only thing that bugs me is the faint halo of some kind of editing near the bottom and the darker line drawn around the legs.  Some layer blending or smudging might make this less obvious.  It''s great anyway.', '2007-01-29 15:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
