(3299417, 460107, 11467, '<td valign="top">I think one of the biggest problems with this picture is the lighting. The on camera flash creates a very flat and uninteresting image. A more directional side lighting could be used to add more mood to the picture. The background also doesn''t add to the image.</td>', 'I think one of the biggest problems with this picture is the lighting. The on camera flash creates a very flat and uninteresting image. A more directional side lighting could be used to add more mood to the picture. The background also doesn''t add to the image.', '2007-01-29 15:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
