(3299434, 460338, 11467, '<td valign="top">An interesting image. The focus is on the eyes but in this case I think the tangled body is what is making the image so it should also be in focus. Perhaps a smaller aperture &amp; more DOF would help a bit. Lighting is also a bit flat. A bit more contrast by using only one of the two side lights which seem to be exactly left &amp; right or lowering one of them might help.</td>', 'An interesting image. The focus is on the eyes but in this case I think the tangled body is what is making the image so it should also be in focus. Perhaps a smaller aperture & more DOF would help a bit. Lighting is also a bit flat. A bit more contrast by using only one of the two side lights which seem to be exactly left & right or lowering one of them might help.', '2007-01-29 15:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
