(3299454, 459520, 11467, '<td valign="top">There are a few things that I don''t like about this image. Firstly the lighting is about as bad as it can get.. Never use the on camera flash direct on from so close. It creates hot spots, reflections, and nasty shadows. You can create a great photo by using side window light, or even a bright desk lamp from the side creating interesting shadows.<br/>Also the crease lines indicating that a bra has very recently been taken off don''t help the image. Before a nude shoot at least 15 mins to 1/2 an hour without tight underwear makes for better pictures.</td>', 'There are a few things that I don''t like about this image. Firstly the lighting is about as bad as it can get.. Never use the on camera flash direct on from so close. It creates hot spots, reflections, and nasty shadows. You can create a great photo by using side window light, or even a bright desk lamp from the side creating interesting shadows.Also the crease lines indicating that a bra has very recently been taken off don''t help the image. Before a nude shoot at least 15 mins to 1/2 an hour without tight underwear makes for better pictures.', '2007-01-29 15:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
