(3299512, 460329, 11467, '<td valign="top">This is probably the hardest image to comment on as I hate it. But in hating it I love it as it brings up emotion. The processing in creating the black is a little badly done between the legs. Respect for posting it.</td>', 'This is probably the hardest image to comment on as I hate it. But in hating it I love it as it brings up emotion. The processing in creating the black is a little badly done between the legs. Respect for posting it.', '2007-01-29 16:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
