(3299553, 460380, 59840, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light. There''s something very classical in the composition and the lighting. The model''s ribs stand out as sort of anachronistic, given the style- one expects a more, well, Rubenesque figure.</td>', 'Beautiful light. There''s something very classical in the composition and the lighting. The model''s ribs stand out as sort of anachronistic, given the style- one expects a more, well, Rubenesque figure.', '2007-01-29 16:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
