(3299565, 459470, 11467, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Even though the light is from the side, as the model is facing straight into the light, it creates a flat image. If you moved the light more behind the subject shining forward, you will get more shadow and see more contours. Crop is good.</td>', 'Great idea. Even though the light is from the side, as the model is facing straight into the light, it creates a flat image. If you moved the light more behind the subject shining forward, you will get more shadow and see more contours. Crop is good.', '2007-01-29 16:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
