(3299701, 459429, 11467, '<td valign="top">Nice body landscape. Focus is great and the water droplets work well. You should try moving the light source behind the subject pointing towards the camera. If you can shield the light from shining into the lens it is good. then you get great shadows and a lit up rim around the body. I love the water droplets you have got here.</td>', 'Nice body landscape. Focus is great and the water droplets work well. You should try moving the light source behind the subject pointing towards the camera. If you can shield the light from shining into the lens it is good. then you get great shadows and a lit up rim around the body. I love the water droplets you have got here.', '2007-01-29 16:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
