(3299732, 460047, 4564, '<td valign="top">I love water and nudes.  This is a superb shot.  I''m not too sure about the position of her left arm which seems numb to me.  Also, personally I always recommend the mouth be opened when the model tilts her head upwards (even if there is water) because it always looks more natural and more sensual as well.  My two cents on a great shot. 8</td>', 'I love water and nudes.  This is a superb shot.  I''m not too sure about the position of her left arm which seems numb to me.  Also, personally I always recommend the mouth be opened when the model tilts her head upwards (even if there is water) because it always looks more natural and more sensual as well.  My two cents on a great shot. 8', '2007-01-29 16:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299742, 457696, 4564, '<td valign="top">To me, this is one of the most original shots of the challenge.  So simple, great pose, straight to the point. Love it.  The saturation of the green is slightly too strong for my taste.  A strong 8 from me.</td>', 'To me, this is one of the most original shots of the challenge.  So simple, great pose, straight to the point. Love it.  The saturation of the green is slightly too strong for my taste.  A strong 8 from me.', '2007-01-29 16:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299750, 460137, 11467, '<td valign="top">Cute , but a bit too high key for me. I can''t see the difference between his back and the background. If I look really hard, I think I can see some wings on his back. Maybe my monitor is too bright, or yours is too dark.. or both.</td>', 'Cute , but a bit too high key for me. I can''t see the difference between his back and the background. If I look really hard, I think I can see some wings on his back. Maybe my monitor is too bright, or yours is too dark.. or both.', '2007-01-29 16:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
