(3299780, 460159, 4564, '<td valign="top">I always like playful nudes.  composition on this one is very nice.  Lighting is great.  Pose is cool.  My only gripe: personally, I would add a breast showing somewhere, may it be partial or complete.  To me, as it is, this shot tells me the model does not want to show anything, and it detracts me from the shot.  I understand the pose is about a shy girl hiding behind a teddy and I don''t argue against this because this is exactly what makes this shot good.  But I think it would add an extra level if a breast was showing "without the subject knowing" even though she is hiding... Dunno if you understand what I mean?  It would make the subject more vulnerable, and I think would add to the shot.  My two cents on an excellent shot. Solid 7</td>', 'I always like playful nudes.  composition on this one is very nice.  Lighting is great.  Pose is cool.  My only gripe: personally, I would add a breast showing somewhere, may it be partial or complete.  To me, as it is, this shot tells me the model does not want to show anything, and it detracts me from the shot.  I understand the pose is about a shy girl hiding behind a teddy and I don''t argue against this because this is exactly what makes this shot good.  But I think it would add an extra level if a breast was showing "without the subject knowing" even though she is hiding... Dunno if you understand what I mean?  It would make the subject more vulnerable, and I think would add to the shot.  My two cents on an excellent shot. Solid 7', '2007-01-29 17:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299782, 458674, 11467, '<td valign="top">I think this image will loose points as the arm is blown out with too much light, and it is unsharp and blurry.</td>', 'I think this image will loose points as the arm is blown out with too much light, and it is unsharp and blurry.', '2007-01-29 17:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299792, 459540, 4564, '<td valign="top">Welcome to the Nude challenge. Nice shot.  Nice use of body curves. My suggestion: to move the hand further in the back to reveal more of the natural curve of the woman''s bottom.  I think the curves are what make this shot interesting, and not the hand.  As it is, the hand is masking too much.  Good thing: love the fact that the man''s hand has a ring: it gives a context to the shot. Very nice detail.  Keep it up!</td>', 'Welcome to the Nude challenge. Nice shot.  Nice use of body curves. My suggestion: to move the hand further in the back to reveal more of the natural curve of the woman''s bottom.  I think the curves are what make this shot interesting, and not the hand.  As it is, the hand is masking too much.  Good thing: love the fact that the man''s hand has a ring: it gives a context to the shot. Very nice detail.  Keep it up!', '2007-01-29 17:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299793, 460044, 11467, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting here is too flat and uninteresting. smaller light source from the side or even a little behind the model then more contrast in post processing can make a stronger image. Crop is spot on.</td>', 'I think the lighting here is too flat and uninteresting. smaller light source from the side or even a little behind the model then more contrast in post processing can make a stronger image. Crop is spot on.', '2007-01-29 17:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
