(3299807, 460391, 11467, '<td valign="top">When I look at this I see someone who is wanting to post an image but doesn''t want anyone to see who it is. Lighting exposure and crop are all quite good, I just think the image would be better wit a letter in the hand to show sorrow, or something to give a reason for this pose.</td>', 'When I look at this I see someone who is wanting to post an image but doesn''t want anyone to see who it is. Lighting exposure and crop are all quite good, I just think the image would be better wit a letter in the hand to show sorrow, or something to give a reason for this pose.', '2007-01-29 17:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299812, 460380, 4564, '<td valign="top">Very original use of a nipple piercing... ;-)  Love the texture contrast between the lemon skin and the model''s skin.  Nice contrast of colors too.  Suggestions: bend elbow more downwards to accentuate the waist.  Crop more horizontal to emphasize the lenght of the body (instead of an almost square crop at the moment).  Ask your model to slightly add some tension in her fingers so it won''t look numb.   And finally, a slightly softer light on the lemons might have made them complement more the model instead of standing out so much more than the model (maybe desaturating the yellow a bit would also help).  Very nice entry. Good luck!</td>', 'Very original use of a nipple piercing... ;-)  Love the texture contrast between the lemon skin and the model''s skin.  Nice contrast of colors too.  Suggestions: bend elbow more downwards to accentuate the waist.  Crop more horizontal to emphasize the lenght of the body (instead of an almost square crop at the moment).  Ask your model to slightly add some tension in her fingers so it won''t look numb.   And finally, a slightly softer light on the lemons might have made them complement more the model instead of standing out so much more than the model (maybe desaturating the yellow a bit would also help).  Very nice entry. Good luck!', '2007-01-29 17:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
