(3299963, 459780, 11467, '<td valign="top">Composition is pretty good. Image is a bit boring probably as there are quite a few similar images. Lighting is terrible. Get your flash off your camera. Either bounce it off something or get a master slave setup, but flash straight on is bad bad bad.</td>', 'Composition is pretty good. Image is a bit boring probably as there are quite a few similar images. Lighting is terrible. Get your flash off your camera. Either bounce it off something or get a master slave setup, but flash straight on is bad bad bad.', '2007-01-29 17:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299967, 459504, 11467, '<td valign="top">I quite like this. It is nice and soft and portrays a nice relaxed feeling. I don''t like the crop that the right arm is half in an half out of the image and the feet are cut off. Exposure seems pretty good.</td>', 'I quite like this. It is nice and soft and portrays a nice relaxed feeling. I don''t like the crop that the right arm is half in an half out of the image and the feet are cut off. Exposure seems pretty good.', '2007-01-29 17:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
