(3299979, 458762, 3032, '<td valign="top">The background is very distracting here. Also moving your model (a lot) further away from the background (and maybe putting a light on it) can help against the hard shadows underneath the arms. Also don''t like the bluepurple hue of the image. Sorry.</td>', 'The background is very distracting here. Also moving your model (a lot) further away from the background (and maybe putting a light on it) can help against the hard shadows underneath the arms. Also don''t like the bluepurple hue of the image. Sorry.', '2007-01-29 17:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299982, 458708, 5112, '<td valign="top">Hi, Judy :)))</td>', 'Hi, Judy :)))', '2007-01-29 17:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299984, 460140, 11467, '<td valign="top">This is cool. I like the atmosphere portrayed. Where this picture looses points is in the B&amp;W conversion. It might have been better in colour, but the skin looks all blotchy. This wouldn''t be too difficult to correct in post processing with a gausian blur or selective channel B&amp;W conversion.<br/>I like the crop &amp; composition.</td>', 'This is cool. I like the atmosphere portrayed. Where this picture looses points is in the B&W conversion. It might have been better in colour, but the skin looks all blotchy. This wouldn''t be too difficult to correct in post processing with a gausian blur or selective channel B&W conversion.I like the crop & composition.', '2007-01-29 17:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299989, 460260, 11467, '<td valign="top">great back lighting, but maybe a little dark in the foreground. A little fill would help. Not sure if I like the crop or the shoes, the crop is too tight on all sides.</td>', 'great back lighting, but maybe a little dark in the foreground. A little fill would help. Not sure if I like the crop or the shoes, the crop is too tight on all sides.', '2007-01-29 17:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
