(3299996, 459822, 11467, '<td valign="top">This could be a great image. But the lighting is not right to bring out the muscle structure. A stronger side light would have probably been better. Also the image is very grainy.</td>', 'This could be a great image. But the lighting is not right to bring out the muscle structure. A stronger side light would have probably been better. Also the image is very grainy.', '2007-01-29 17:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
