(3300036, 458769, 47483, '<td valign="top">The body of the model is very good. (this is what my artistic mind says).<br/> <br/>(And you know what my pervert mind would say).</td>', 'The body of the model is very good. (this is what my artistic mind says). (And you know what my pervert mind would say).', '2007-01-29 18:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3300042, 458762, 11467, '<td valign="top">This could be a great image with better lighting. I love the use of the flowers &amp; the extra accent in the hair. The On camera flash creates a horrible shadow and makes a very flat image. Get your flash off your camera, or fire it onto a white wall to reflect the light back onto the model from the side. in this case the best lighting would be to the right as that is the way the face is looking.  The colours also look very flat in this image. Beautiful model by the way.</td>', 'This could be a great image with better lighting. I love the use of the flowers & the extra accent in the hair. The On camera flash creates a horrible shadow and makes a very flat image. Get your flash off your camera, or fire it onto a white wall to reflect the light back onto the model from the side. in this case the best lighting would be to the right as that is the way the face is looking.  The colours also look very flat in this image. Beautiful model by the way.', '2007-01-29 18:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3300047, 460392, 11467, '<td valign="top">Not a bad image considering you just came out of the shower. The water on the mirror distracts me.</td>', 'Not a bad image considering you just came out of the shower. The water on the mirror distracts me.', '2007-01-29 18:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3300056, 459857, 11467, '<td valign="top">Great idea and nice lighting. I would like to see less of the folds of the background though (My laptop is quite right)</td>', 'Great idea and nice lighting. I would like to see less of the folds of the background though (My laptop is quite right)', '2007-01-29 18:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3300062, 458917, 11467, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the flat front on lighting. Nice body &amp; I think that by getting the light off to the side could bring out fantastic details in the arms.</td>', 'Don''t like the flat front on lighting. Nice body & I think that by getting the light off to the side could bring out fantastic details in the arms.', '2007-01-29 18:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
