(3300101, 459808, 5885, '<td valign="top">It was a cute idea, but I really can''t bring myself to vote this high considering all the photogs that shot nudes of others and themselves.</td>', 'It was a cute idea, but I really can''t bring myself to vote this high considering all the photogs that shot nudes of others and themselves.', '2007-01-29 18:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
