(3301290, 460137, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh, I hope you aren''t getting killed for having a baby in this challenge.   Because I love baby photos so much, but I think they may be kinda hard on them in any challenge -- but maybe more so in this one.   I hope not.   I think its cute, and I like the high key look alot.  Good luck!</td>', 'Oh, I hope you aren''t getting killed for having a baby in this challenge.   Because I love baby photos so much, but I think they may be kinda hard on them in any challenge -- but maybe more so in this one.   I hope not.   I think its cute, and I like the high key look alot.  Good luck!', '2007-01-29 23:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
