(3301301, 458637, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!   Tasteful.  flawless lighting and execution!   So far, one of my very few 10''s.</td>', 'Very nicely done!   Tasteful.  flawless lighting and execution!   So far, one of my very few 10''s.', '2007-01-29 23:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
