(3301309, 460159, 23318, '<td valign="top">Great lighting. A very interesting pose. I think the banister rail is a bit distracting. I also think her feet appear a bit too uncomfortable, however the shape the pointed feet add to the legs does add to some great definition, so I wouldn''t worry too much about that. I think that if the model was looking at the camera, it might have added to your score as well.</td>', 'Great lighting. A very interesting pose. I think the banister rail is a bit distracting. I also think her feet appear a bit too uncomfortable, however the shape the pointed feet add to the legs does add to some great definition, so I wouldn''t worry too much about that. I think that if the model was looking at the camera, it might have added to your score as well.', '2007-01-29 23:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301311, 460036, 24454, '<td valign="top">Beautiful set-up!  I wish there was just a little more contrast, but it''s still very nicely done.</td>', 'Beautiful set-up!  I wish there was just a little more contrast, but it''s still very nicely done.', '2007-01-29 23:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301317, 458708, 24454, '<td valign="top">There''s my friend  :)    I think you did a fantastic job on this!   Very artful.  Very emotive.  Very flattering to you!   I hope its scoring well!</td>', 'There''s my friend  :)    I think you did a fantastic job on this!   Very artful.  Very emotive.  Very flattering to you!   I hope its scoring well!', '2007-01-29 23:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301322, 458435, 23318, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting, slightly flat, but works with the title. The pose is a bit boring, and works a bit against the title... unless the devious is you taking the picture without her knowing, but it''s not quite right for that either. I think the shadows on the right side is a bit odd, but the falloff on the left side actually adds a bit of interest. I like the idea of the hair, but it just doesn''t quite work right, cause it almost blends into the background.</td>', 'Interesting lighting, slightly flat, but works with the title. The pose is a bit boring, and works a bit against the title... unless the devious is you taking the picture without her knowing, but it''s not quite right for that either. I think the shadows on the right side is a bit odd, but the falloff on the left side actually adds a bit of interest. I like the idea of the hair, but it just doesn''t quite work right, cause it almost blends into the background.', '2007-01-29 23:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301327, 460250, 23318, '<td valign="top">I like subject, props, and the general idea of the shot. I think the lighting is great, but I think the background would have paid off better with black. The model is kinda pale, and the excellent lighting would have still made the hat stand out from the background. That would have also eliminated the distracting shadow of her arm and right behind the neck. <br/> <br/>FUn shot. Goodluck.</td>', 'I like subject, props, and the general idea of the shot. I think the lighting is great, but I think the background would have paid off better with black. The model is kinda pale, and the excellent lighting would have still made the hat stand out from the background. That would have also eliminated the distracting shadow of her arm and right behind the neck.  FUn shot. Goodluck.', '2007-01-29 23:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301333, 460380, 71189, '<td valign="top">i like the use of the lemosn<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-04-01 20:08:50.</i></td>', 'i like the use of the lemosn', '2007-01-29 23:42:21.000000', '2007-04-01 21:08:50.000000', 1),
(3301334, 460054, 64612, '<td valign="top">DNMC</td>', 'DNMC', '2007-01-29 23:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301339, 460064, 71189, '<td valign="top">wow, very pretty body...nice composition</td>', 'wow, very pretty body...nice composition', '2007-01-29 23:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301354, 460475, 23318, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. I think the only think I can suggest for improvement is the distracting arm on the far side. That may cause some annoyance on the nitpickers. Good Luck</td>', 'Beautiful shot. I think the only think I can suggest for improvement is the distracting arm on the far side. That may cause some annoyance on the nitpickers. Good Luck', '2007-01-29 23:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301359, 460338, 23318, '<td valign="top">Lighting is beautiful, I like the idea. As a figure study, it''s fabulous. I might have increased the depth of field slightly to allow a bit more detail in the leg hair, but that''s the only minor detail that I could think of. Good Luck</td>', 'Lighting is beautiful, I like the idea. As a figure study, it''s fabulous. I might have increased the depth of field slightly to allow a bit more detail in the leg hair, but that''s the only minor detail that I could think of. Good Luck', '2007-01-29 23:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301370, 460173, 23318, '<td valign="top">Lovely pose. (And Model). It''s REALLY tough to see that she''s cold. I kinda see a goosebump texture in that middle area of shadow on her back, and arm, but it''s not that detailed in this size. In a full size print. It''s probably well defined though. THe ring on her middle finger is slightly distracting, but that''s the only distraction.</td>', 'Lovely pose. (And Model). It''s REALLY tough to see that she''s cold. I kinda see a goosebump texture in that middle area of shadow on her back, and arm, but it''s not that detailed in this size. In a full size print. It''s probably well defined though. THe ring on her middle finger is slightly distracting, but that''s the only distraction.', '2007-01-29 23:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301375, 460341, 23318, '<td valign="top">I can''t imagine post-processing this shot... insanity would have set in for me. Beautiful image though. I have no suggestions to make this one better. Good Luck.</td>', 'I can''t imagine post-processing this shot... insanity would have set in for me. Beautiful image though. I have no suggestions to make this one better. Good Luck.', '2007-01-29 23:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301415, 460044, 23318, '<td valign="top">I don''t see alot of vulnerable here... but that won''t hurt your score any from me. I think the placement is just a little bit off, and the toes being slightly  covered by the black flooring makes the foot look odd. However the lighting is quite good, it''s slightly flat, but still quite good. Good Luck</td>', 'I don''t see alot of vulnerable here... but that won''t hurt your score any from me. I think the placement is just a little bit off, and the toes being slightly  covered by the black flooring makes the foot look odd. However the lighting is quite good, it''s slightly flat, but still quite good. Good Luck', '2007-01-30 00:10:34.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3301418, 457696, 23318, '<td valign="top">Holy crap. THis is the most origional shot I''ve seen in a long time. Very interesting. I think the color hue could be better, but it didn''t hurt what score I gave you. I hope you explain how you did this one.</td>', 'Holy crap. THis is the most origional shot I''ve seen in a long time. Very interesting. I think the color hue could be better, but it didn''t hurt what score I gave you. I hope you explain how you did this one.', '2007-01-30 00:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301433, 459758, 23318, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing shot. I like the reflections in the sunglasses, but I don''t like that I can see part of her eyes. I would have I think prefereed the glasses up a bit higherto hide that, but still show the reflection. Good Luck</td>', 'Very intriguing shot. I like the reflections in the sunglasses, but I don''t like that I can see part of her eyes. I would have I think prefereed the glasses up a bit higherto hide that, but still show the reflection. Good Luck', '2007-01-30 00:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301437, 460138, 49598, '<td valign="top">You can''t be serious.</td>', 'You can''t be serious.', '2007-01-30 00:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301438, 459528, 7485, '<td valign="top">The getting undressed look makes for a sexy image, but if that''s what you were after then you should have gone for a come-hither expression</td>', 'The getting undressed look makes for a sexy image, but if that''s what you were after then you should have gone for a come-hither expression', '2007-01-30 00:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301445, 460470, 49598, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, but the composition seems maybe a little busy.  I don''t know for sure, but beyond the color, it doesn''t have much of a "wow" factor.</td>', 'Nice colors, but the composition seems maybe a little busy.  I don''t know for sure, but beyond the color, it doesn''t have much of a "wow" factor.', '2007-01-30 00:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301448, 459764, 49598, '<td valign="top">This actually creeps me out a little bit... perhaps better color would make it a little more interesting.  Clever though.</td>', 'This actually creeps me out a little bit... perhaps better color would make it a little more interesting.  Clever though.', '2007-01-30 00:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301451, 459628, 7485, '<td valign="top">The lighting is good, but the pose and composition don''t work for me. The crop on the right seems needlessly tight.</td>', 'The lighting is good, but the pose and composition don''t work for me. The crop on the right seems needlessly tight.', '2007-01-30 00:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301455, 460399, 7485, '<td valign="top">The details and texture on the bed are excellent. Wish I could see little more of your model, the legs in particular.</td>', 'The details and texture on the bed are excellent. Wish I could see little more of your model, the legs in particular.', '2007-01-30 00:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301457, 459425, 49598, '<td valign="top">The shadow of the face makes this photo intriguing.  Good composition, but there is a kind of weird imbalance between the breast which is very lit, and the face and arm which are in deep shadow.  To me, this makes the breast the primary element, with the face being secondary (which you may have intended, but the face is so nice that I hate to come across it second).  Hope this made any kind of sense.</td>', 'The shadow of the face makes this photo intriguing.  Good composition, but there is a kind of weird imbalance between the breast which is very lit, and the face and arm which are in deep shadow.  To me, this makes the breast the primary element, with the face being secondary (which you may have intended, but the face is so nice that I hate to come across it second).  Hope this made any kind of sense.', '2007-01-30 00:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301462, 460279, 65603, '<td valign="top">The breat clutching is unappealing but love the edit.</td>', 'The breat clutching is unappealing but love the edit.', '2007-01-30 00:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301464, 459524, 7485, '<td valign="top">Looks over-processed to me, or maybe the focus was off by a bit since her face looks soft but the pillow looks sharp. Also the orange-red of the flowers clashes with the maroon-red background.</td>', 'Looks over-processed to me, or maybe the focus was off by a bit since her face looks soft but the pillow looks sharp. Also the orange-red of the flowers clashes with the maroon-red background.', '2007-01-30 00:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301465, 459472, 49598, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea well executed.</td>', 'Very cool idea well executed.', '2007-01-30 00:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301471, 460215, 49598, '<td valign="top">Odd, but clever.</td>', 'Odd, but clever.', '2007-01-30 00:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301474, 460190, 49598, '<td valign="top">Not very interesting, and i don''t feel like a sliver of a shoulder falls into the "nude" category very well.</td>', 'Not very interesting, and i don''t feel like a sliver of a shoulder falls into the "nude" category very well.', '2007-01-30 00:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301479, 459871, 49598, '<td valign="top">The camera angle makes this shot distorted in a not very flattering way.  Maybe try to get a lower angle so the breasts don''t look much larger than the legs.</td>', 'The camera angle makes this shot distorted in a not very flattering way.  Maybe try to get a lower angle so the breasts don''t look much larger than the legs.', '2007-01-30 00:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301480, 460380, 30454, '<td valign="top">Winner. Blue for sure. I really like the lighting here.</td>', 'Winner. Blue for sure. I really like the lighting here.', '2007-01-30 00:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301482, 460047, 30454, '<td valign="top">Nice ''N Refreshing. Like the lighting and B&amp;W. A ribbon for sure.</td>', 'Nice ''N Refreshing. Like the lighting and B&W. A ribbon for sure.', '2007-01-30 00:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301489, 458149, 49598, '<td valign="top">Looks way over-processed.</td>', 'Looks way over-processed.', '2007-01-30 00:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301496, 460173, 49598, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  The stray hairs seem distracting (or maybe I''m just picky!) - I think maybe if the hair were completely wet and the expression slightly more natural, this could go from a "good" photo to a "great" photo.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  The stray hairs seem distracting (or maybe I''m just picky!) - I think maybe if the hair were completely wet and the expression slightly more natural, this could go from a "good" photo to a "great" photo.', '2007-01-30 00:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301499, 459893, 26756, '<td valign="top">Different, lots of textures, good pose and very nice.  The crop at the face is a little strangely placed. I think this would work better with the whole head showing, even if the face were turned so the person can''t be recognized.  Good shot.</td>', 'Different, lots of textures, good pose and very nice.  The crop at the face is a little strangely placed. I think this would work better with the whole head showing, even if the face were turned so the person can''t be recognized.  Good shot.', '2007-01-30 00:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301501, 460210, 49598, '<td valign="top">Needs to be much sharper, and it looks like parts (namely the right elbow) were cropped or something in photoshop poorly.  If that''s not the case, something is giving it that effect.  The lighting could also be much better, and the glass should be more visible if that''s what you''re going for.</td>', 'Needs to be much sharper, and it looks like parts (namely the right elbow) were cropped or something in photoshop poorly.  If that''s not the case, something is giving it that effect.  The lighting could also be much better, and the glass should be more visible if that''s what you''re going for.', '2007-01-30 00:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301506, 457696, 49598, '<td valign="top">So weird.  I can''t decide whether or not I like it, but it certainly is interesting.</td>', 'So weird.  I can''t decide whether or not I like it, but it certainly is interesting.', '2007-01-30 00:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301509, 459822, 49598, '<td valign="top">The contour of the body here is really interesting, but it seems like it could be a bit sharper.  Good job though.</td>', 'The contour of the body here is really interesting, but it seems like it could be a bit sharper.  Good job though.', '2007-01-30 00:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301516, 460253, 49598, '<td valign="top">It has a kind of 1950s movie feel to it.  I''m not sure what those highlights on her back are.  The blue of the lens takes away from it, though, in my opinion.</td>', 'It has a kind of 1950s movie feel to it.  I''m not sure what those highlights on her back are.  The blue of the lens takes away from it, though, in my opinion.', '2007-01-30 00:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
