(3301597, 460450, 49598, '<td valign="top">The background color, the dresser, and the flowers are all very distracting, and the whole scene seems to be lit poorly.  You should try to use lighting and depth of field to establish a primary subject, and then perhaps another that is secondary.  This photo is rather flat in lighting and depth.</td>', 'The background color, the dresser, and the flowers are all very distracting, and the whole scene seems to be lit poorly.  You should try to use lighting and depth of field to establish a primary subject, and then perhaps another that is secondary.  This photo is rather flat in lighting and depth.', '2007-01-30 01:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
