(3301786, 460107, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea. Would probably be more effective and a stronger presentation if you used like a black sheet or something for a solid plain background, and not have the doorframe and other elements.</td>', 'This is a good idea. Would probably be more effective and a stronger presentation if you used like a black sheet or something for a solid plain background, and not have the doorframe and other elements.', '2007-01-30 03:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301789, 460399, 19831, '<td valign="top">Good job on the lighting and exposure. I am thinking a little tighter crop may make this image stronger. The negative space top and bottom don''t seem to be contributing to the composition in this case.</td>', 'Good job on the lighting and exposure. I am thinking a little tighter crop may make this image stronger. The negative space top and bottom don''t seem to be contributing to the composition in this case.', '2007-01-30 03:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301794, 460423, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is a good composition. I like the incorporation of the shadows. I think I see what you are doing with the processing, and can appreciate it, but I am honestly not real crazy about it. Maybe if were just a little subdued. But, that is just my tastes :-)</td>', 'This is a good composition. I like the incorporation of the shadows. I think I see what you are doing with the processing, and can appreciate it, but I am honestly not real crazy about it. Maybe if were just a little subdued. But, that is just my tastes :-)', '2007-01-30 03:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301802, 460338, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very creative, and an interesting study of human form. Although it looks uncomfortable :-) I really like the shapes you''ve achieved here. Nice lighting too. I am thinking though, that maybe going for deeper dof might tie it all together stronger in this case.</td>', 'Very creative, and an interesting study of human form. Although it looks uncomfortable :-) I really like the shapes you''ve achieved here. Nice lighting too. I am thinking though, that maybe going for deeper dof might tie it all together stronger in this case.', '2007-01-30 03:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301812, 459469, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea. I like it. Executed pretty good, the lighting and focus etc. is good. What I am unsure of, is the composition. Subject seems kind of centered and in this case seems to lack a littly dynamically. It doesn''t seem like the negative space at the sides is contributing much to the theme. I am wondering if a tighter crop might work well here? Or perhaps using a portrait orientation, placing the negative space at the top of frame, it might add to the sense of ''repression'', the weight bearing down on the subject? I like the idea though, and the technicals look good.</td>', 'This is a great idea. I like it. Executed pretty good, the lighting and focus etc. is good. What I am unsure of, is the composition. Subject seems kind of centered and in this case seems to lack a littly dynamically. It doesn''t seem like the negative space at the sides is contributing much to the theme. I am wondering if a tighter crop might work well here? Or perhaps using a portrait orientation, placing the negative space at the top of frame, it might add to the sense of ''repression'', the weight bearing down on the subject? I like the idea though, and the technicals look good.', '2007-01-30 03:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301820, 460147, 19831, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition. Exquisite lighting. Superb study of the beauty of human form. Outstanding work!</td>', 'Wonderful composition. Exquisite lighting. Superb study of the beauty of human form. Outstanding work!', '2007-01-30 03:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301825, 459871, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. A lovely study of form. I really like the concept, and how you''ve used light here. I wish there was just a slight bit less negative space at right. Definitely not a lot less, just a tad, I think it would echo the form a little stronger if it were a little less. A beautiful shot though, very good job.</td>', 'Nice idea. A lovely study of form. I really like the concept, and how you''ve used light here. I wish there was just a slight bit less negative space at right. Definitely not a lot less, just a tad, I think it would echo the form a little stronger if it were a little less. A beautiful shot though, very good job.', '2007-01-30 03:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301830, 459540, 19831, '<td valign="top">Wonderful play of light and shadow. Nice lines/curves that draw the eye nicely accross the image. Nice job.</td>', 'Wonderful play of light and shadow. Nice lines/curves that draw the eye nicely accross the image. Nice job.', '2007-01-30 03:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
