(3301837, 459874, 19831, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm...an interesting image. When I saw the thumbnail, it didn''t look like it really appeal to me. But upon seeing the full size image, it strikes me as kind of an abstract, and I actually quite like it. The yellow/gold tone adds to the photo, in this case, IMO. Nice job :-)</td>', 'Hmmmm...an interesting image. When I saw the thumbnail, it didn''t look like it really appeal to me. But upon seeing the full size image, it strikes me as kind of an abstract, and I actually quite like it. The yellow/gold tone adds to the photo, in this case, IMO. Nice job :-)', '2007-01-30 03:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301840, 460153, 49109, '<td valign="top">technically almost excellent, light on her chest is a bit harsh. well composed, except I don''t like how her leg and his feet are cropped. his expression - priceless!</td>', 'technically almost excellent, light on her chest is a bit harsh. well composed, except I don''t like how her leg and his feet are cropped. his expression - priceless!', '2007-01-30 03:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
