(3301853, 460279, 49109, '<td valign="top">good lighting, pose and expression. don''t care for the partial coloring/desat - doesn''t add IMO. she seems a bit lost there in the center, wish the composition was more interesting or there was some background included. had cloned out the tattoo on the foot or presented it nicer</td>', 'good lighting, pose and expression. don''t care for the partial coloring/desat - doesn''t add IMO. she seems a bit lost there in the center, wish the composition was more interesting or there was some background included. had cloned out the tattoo on the foot or presented it nicer', '2007-01-30 03:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3301856, 460450, 19831, '<td valign="top">A nice idea. I like the classic pose. I think the lighting seems a little harsh, and is holding back the presentation here. See the pronounced shadows on the right of model, flowers and bureau? Maybe diffusing your light source, going for a more subdued look could strengthen the image.</td>', 'A nice idea. I like the classic pose. I think the lighting seems a little harsh, and is holding back the presentation here. See the pronounced shadows on the right of model, flowers and bureau? Maybe diffusing your light source, going for a more subdued look could strengthen the image.', '2007-01-30 03:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
