(3302759, 459299, 68972, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if I''m looking at some glasses and your awesome PS skills or you may have some great props but I think it''s awesome!  Great idea and follow through!  I love the light over the sheet and your main subject!  I hope this does well for you!</td>', 'I''m not sure if I''m looking at some glasses and your awesome PS skills or you may have some great props but I think it''s awesome!  Great idea and follow through!  I love the light over the sheet and your main subject!  I hope this does well for you!', '2007-01-30 12:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
