(3302792, 458762, 46314, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems a bit harsh, especially for a nude with flowers. The processing also seems to have drained the image of colour, which is a shame, given that her hair seems like it would add nice red splash of colour to the photo.</td>', 'Lighting seems a bit harsh, especially for a nude with flowers. The processing also seems to have drained the image of colour, which is a shame, given that her hair seems like it would add nice red splash of colour to the photo.', '2007-01-30 12:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3302797, 458769, 68972, '<td valign="top">Very profound and sexy.  I''m not sure if it was your intention or not but I like the way her (viewer''s left) right nipple caught a highlight against the shadow and her hair seems to be blowing.  Tastefully well don w/wonderful light!  Good job!</td>', 'Very profound and sexy.  I''m not sure if it was your intention or not but I like the way her (viewer''s left) right nipple caught a highlight against the shadow and her hair seems to be blowing.  Tastefully well don w/wonderful light!  Good job!', '2007-01-30 12:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3302800, 460279, 46314, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting. The red material gives a nice strong base to the composition.</td>', 'Very nice lighting. The red material gives a nice strong base to the composition.', '2007-01-30 12:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3302802, 460102, 46314, '<td valign="top">Well-lit.</td>', 'Well-lit.', '2007-01-30 12:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3302803, 460195, 68972, '<td valign="top">Great direction of light an interesting perspective.  I love this idea!  I wonder: Did you intend for his feet to be so dark?  I would like to see a little more light on his feet for clarity.. just like his shoulders.  But that''s just my opinion.  Great image!  I like the light on his left (veiwer''s right) hand most of all.</td>', 'Great direction of light an interesting perspective.  I love this idea!  I wonder: Did you intend for his feet to be so dark?  I would like to see a little more light on his feet for clarity.. just like his shoulders.  But that''s just my opinion.  Great image!  I like the light on his left (veiwer''s right) hand most of all.', '2007-01-30 12:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3302807, 459978, 46314, '<td valign="top">Awkward pose. It doesn''t really create an interesting form for the photo.</td>', 'Awkward pose. It doesn''t really create an interesting form for the photo.', '2007-01-30 12:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
