(3303989, 459978, 72714, '<td valign="top">I think more of the models back should have been included to add contours to the photo. Perhaps composed to include the lower back and the rise of the buttocks. Also, watch for underwear marks.</td>', 'I think more of the models back should have been included to add contours to the photo. Perhaps composed to include the lower back and the rise of the buttocks. Also, watch for underwear marks.', '2007-01-30 17:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3304000, 460047, 72714, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image with a refreshing feeling added by the water. Perfect shutter speed captured the droplets as slight streaks, adding movement. Nicely done!</td>', 'Beautiful image with a refreshing feeling added by the water. Perfect shutter speed captured the droplets as slight streaks, adding movement. Nicely done!', '2007-01-30 17:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3304007, 460054, 72714, '<td valign="top">I like the humour! Well thought out!</td>', 'I like the humour! Well thought out!', '2007-01-30 17:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3304019, 460147, 48389, '<td valign="top">I like your composition and you ahve captured some nice detail in the water droplets but for me this is just a little too dark</td>', 'I like your composition and you ahve captured some nice detail in the water droplets but for me this is just a little too dark', '2007-01-30 17:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3304025, 458330, 72714, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft lighting. The shape of the head is a bit lost in the shadow at the back though, maybe slight backlighting to add a very faint rim? Maybe not? I like the photo anyway. Well captured!</td>', 'Lovely soft lighting. The shape of the head is a bit lost in the shadow at the back though, maybe slight backlighting to add a very faint rim? Maybe not? I like the photo anyway. Well captured!', '2007-01-30 17:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3304028, 460474, 48389, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and editing but think I would prefer the two ideas seperatly. By this I mean the old fashioned feel I get from the editing you have done works nicely with the model but the stones some how add a touch of modern that doesn''t quite fit. Just my humble opinion :o)</td>', 'I like the composition and editing but think I would prefer the two ideas seperatly. By this I mean the old fashioned feel I get from the editing you have done works nicely with the model but the stones some how add a touch of modern that doesn''t quite fit. Just my humble opinion :o)', '2007-01-30 17:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3304044, 457276, 48389, '<td valign="top">I really like the softness of the skin and the colouring of the hair and body go nicely together.The pose is good but for me there is something about her eyes being closed that doesn''t feel quite right(just my humble opinion) :o)</td>', 'I really like the softness of the skin and the colouring of the hair and body go nicely together.The pose is good but for me there is something about her eyes being closed that doesn''t feel quite right(just my humble opinion) :o)', '2007-01-30 17:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3304047, 460157, 48389, '<td valign="top">The model looks very uncomfortable here which is quite off putting. The lighting is nice and I like the B&amp;W :o)</td>', 'The model looks very uncomfortable here which is quite off putting. The lighting is nice and I like the B&W :o)', '2007-01-30 17:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3304090, 460322, 67145, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot .. excellent composition and great contrasts .. =9</td>', 'beautiful shot .. excellent composition and great contrasts .. =9', '2007-01-30 17:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3304093, 460260, 67145, '<td valign="top">stunning ... beautiful .. great lighting ....... =9</td>', 'stunning ... beautiful .. great lighting ....... =9', '2007-01-30 17:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3304099, 460450, 22301, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your baby! I think this photo has some potential but loses some of its effectiveness by using the onboard flash for a few reasons. First it gives very strong shadows on the wall, second I think it does not do too much to help show the lines of the mother to be. One thing that can help get more of a natural feel is to set your flash to rear curtain and cover your flash with tissue to help diffuse the flash. The rear curtain will help let ambient light in to help with the flash also. I think the drawers seem to be the dominate the frame and take the emphasis from your model abit also. But I do really like her pose and think it works quite well. Just my opinion, congrats again.</td>', 'Congrats on your baby! I think this photo has some potential but loses some of its effectiveness by using the onboard flash for a few reasons. First it gives very strong shadows on the wall, second I think it does not do too much to help show the lines of the mother to be. One thing that can help get more of a natural feel is to set your flash to rear curtain and cover your flash with tissue to help diffuse the flash. The rear curtain will help let ambient light in to help with the flash also. I think the drawers seem to be the dominate the frame and take the emphasis from your model abit also. But I do really like her pose and think it works quite well. Just my opinion, congrats again.', '2007-01-30 17:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3304107, 459893, 67145, '<td valign="top">beautiful .... great composition, excellent feel to this photo ... love it ... =9</td>', 'beautiful .... great composition, excellent feel to this photo ... love it ... =9', '2007-01-30 17:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3304109, 460210, 22301, '<td valign="top">The lighting is good but your photo appears out of focus.</td>', 'The lighting is good but your photo appears out of focus.', '2007-01-30 17:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
