(3304392, 460138, 23318, '<td valign="top">I thought that this image was very crude, though, I don''t have a problem with the crudeness. I Did however think it''s quite a bit out of focus, the shadows are distracting, and it''s nearly impossible to see the reason for this photo. I wish you luck, and hope that you don''t get torn up too much after voting ends for your choice of subject.</td>', 'I thought that this image was very crude, though, I don''t have a problem with the crudeness. I Did however think it''s quite a bit out of focus, the shadows are distracting, and it''s nearly impossible to see the reason for this photo. I wish you luck, and hope that you don''t get torn up too much after voting ends for your choice of subject.', '2007-01-30 19:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3304407, 458943, 23318, '<td valign="top">I LOVE the composition. It''s very nice, but it''s execution, I''d like to see cleaned up. #1, I don''t like the desat, B&amp;W or color here would be fine, but the desat isn''t right. if you REALLY want to do the desat, desat the guitar, and not the girl. And then do something about the flash on the guitar, light it from the side or something to make that reflection go away. Great start though, and PLEASE reshoot, cause I''d love to see it without the flash at least.</td>', 'I LOVE the composition. It''s very nice, but it''s execution, I''d like to see cleaned up. #1, I don''t like the desat, B&W or color here would be fine, but the desat isn''t right. if you REALLY want to do the desat, desat the guitar, and not the girl. And then do something about the flash on the guitar, light it from the side or something to make that reflection go away. Great start though, and PLEASE reshoot, cause I''d love to see it without the flash at least.', '2007-01-30 19:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3304418, 460392, 11518, '<td valign="top">Light is flat, there''s a lack of contrast and the B &amp; W conversion doesn''t quite work.  Crop is somewhat tight, the model looks boxed in.  Interesting pose though.</td>', 'Light is flat, there''s a lack of contrast and the B & W conversion doesn''t quite work.  Crop is somewhat tight, the model looks boxed in.  Interesting pose though.', '2007-01-30 19:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
