(3304854, 460122, 7485, '<td valign="top">An intriguing idea, but I think I''d like it better if the skin were sharper, so the texture really stood out.</td>', 'An intriguing idea, but I think I''d like it better if the skin were sharper, so the texture really stood out.', '2007-01-30 22:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
