(3304959, 460102, 70631, '<td valign="top">Cool! The only thing I can suggest to change is that she gives a little more of the trademark Elvis expression.</td>', 'Cool! The only thing I can suggest to change is that she gives a little more of the trademark Elvis expression.', '2007-01-30 22:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
