(3306840, 459504, 24073, '<td valign="top">IMHO, a reflector behind the shoot highlighting her hair line would be good, and then darker shadows for the rest of her body would make this a notch better.  Still a great photo.</td>', 'IMHO, a reflector behind the shoot highlighting her hair line would be good, and then darker shadows for the rest of her body would make this a notch better.  Still a great photo.', '2007-01-31 08:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3306854, 460450, 24073, '<td valign="top">A nice photo indeed.  I''m wondering if the frame was squeezed tighter to show only the flowers, face, breast, and background, if that would notch this photo up.  As it sits, its right in the middle.  Nothing that makes it over the top, and nothing that sinks it below average.  The spectrum of colors is very pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'A nice photo indeed.  I''m wondering if the frame was squeezed tighter to show only the flowers, face, breast, and background, if that would notch this photo up.  As it sits, its right in the middle.  Nothing that makes it over the top, and nothing that sinks it below average.  The spectrum of colors is very pleasing to the eye.', '2007-01-31 08:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3306872, 459643, 24073, '<td valign="top">your model looks posed, and cold.  Maybe a beer or two to lighten her spirits would have been a good tactic.  As a matter of fact, I struggle too with getting my model to lighten up, maybe I will try the beer or two thing myself.  Still a wonderful photo, and an absolutely stunning model.</td>', 'your model looks posed, and cold.  Maybe a beer or two to lighten her spirits would have been a good tactic.  As a matter of fact, I struggle too with getting my model to lighten up, maybe I will try the beer or two thing myself.  Still a wonderful photo, and an absolutely stunning model.', '2007-01-31 08:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3306885, 460474, 24073, '<td valign="top">I do like the texture  you used in this photo, it works well with the props.  However, I don''t think you nailed the over the top appeal.  Its still effective, and very pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'I do like the texture  you used in this photo, it works well with the props.  However, I don''t think you nailed the over the top appeal.  Its still effective, and very pleasing to the eye.', '2007-01-31 08:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3306899, 460044, 24073, '<td valign="top">I do like this photo alot.  One problem I see is that this pose is so overly used here on DP and it maybe tuff to get this typical pose into the top 10.  Though the pose is typical, it is still powerful, and you done a very nice job in the execution category, much better than I could of.  GL.</td>', 'I do like this photo alot.  One problem I see is that this pose is so overly used here on DP and it maybe tuff to get this typical pose into the top 10.  Though the pose is typical, it is still powerful, and you done a very nice job in the execution category, much better than I could of.  GL.', '2007-01-31 08:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3306902, 459764, 72268, '<td valign="top">Nice work, very creative idea. I love this.</td>', 'Nice work, very creative idea. I love this.', '2007-01-31 08:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3306904, 458708, 72268, '<td valign="top">Good show of emotion here, not wanting to get up</td>', 'Good show of emotion here, not wanting to get up', '2007-01-31 08:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3306907, 458943, 72268, '<td valign="top">This one is funny.</td>', 'This one is funny.', '2007-01-31 08:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
