(3307311, 456935, 38738, '<td valign="top">very cute</td>', 'very cute', '2007-01-31 10:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3307358, 459528, 9690, '<td valign="top">I have looked at the entries a couple of times, and I have to say this is my favorite.  There may be others that have greater technical merit, but this one conveys more emotion than any other.  The model''s look, form, expression, and motion in undressing are all very alluring and erotic.  But it is done in a very innocent and honest way.  She is very natural.  Its hard to explain, but this is the only pic that really appealed to me beyond a visual level.</td>', 'I have looked at the entries a couple of times, and I have to say this is my favorite.  There may be others that have greater technical merit, but this one conveys more emotion than any other.  The model''s look, form, expression, and motion in undressing are all very alluring and erotic.  But it is done in a very innocent and honest way.  She is very natural.  Its hard to explain, but this is the only pic that really appealed to me beyond a visual level.', '2007-01-31 10:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
