(3308023, 459643, 48954, '<td valign="top">Comp is off here. She''s way to close to the edge and the feet are cut off, adn that unfortunately makes it look very ackward in my opinion. Not appealing to the eye even though the model is very attractive. The capture of the moment itself is good, even the lightining is good, but Comp....needs some work. 6</td>', 'Comp is off here. She''s way to close to the edge and the feet are cut off, adn that unfortunately makes it look very ackward in my opinion. Not appealing to the eye even though the model is very attractive. The capture of the moment itself is good, even the lightining is good, but Comp....needs some work. 6', '2007-01-31 12:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3308032, 460054, 48954, '<td valign="top">cool shot but DNMC :(</td>', 'cool shot but DNMC :(', '2007-01-31 12:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3308172, 460428, 29474, '<td valign="top">I think that this has been made to dark (in an attempt to hide against detection). A crop through the middle with the left portion being kept makes this a more powerful image.</td>', 'I think that this has been made to dark (in an attempt to hide against detection). A crop through the middle with the left portion being kept makes this a more powerful image.', '2007-01-31 12:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3308177, 460482, 29474, '<td valign="top">I wonder if a wall or something similar would have made this more mysterious. Hiding behind her arm looks uncomfortable.</td>', 'I wonder if a wall or something similar would have made this more mysterious. Hiding behind her arm looks uncomfortable.', '2007-01-31 12:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3308192, 459299, 29474, '<td valign="top">I think that the glass tubes detract from this image. If they had been used to frame the model the might serve a purpose.</td>', 'I think that the glass tubes detract from this image. If they had been used to frame the model the might serve a purpose.', '2007-01-31 12:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3308277, 457824, 29474, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred the highlight on the belly and not the chest and breasts.</td>', 'I would have preferred the highlight on the belly and not the chest and breasts.', '2007-01-31 13:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3308318, 460064, 26255, '<td valign="top">This is definitely a unique shot, but honestly I''m not a huge fan of it.  I can''t really explain why, but I think it may be the mix of light temperatures.  You have warm tones in the background and rimlight, but a cooler light source lighting the front of the model.</td>', 'This is definitely a unique shot, but honestly I''m not a huge fan of it.  I can''t really explain why, but I think it may be the mix of light temperatures.  You have warm tones in the background and rimlight, but a cooler light source lighting the front of the model.', '2007-01-31 13:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3308322, 460250, 26255, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this shot could be much better.  Your model is too close to the background creating harsh shadows and exposing wrinkles in the background.</td>', 'The lighting on this shot could be much better.  Your model is too close to the background creating harsh shadows and exposing wrinkles in the background.', '2007-01-31 13:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3308336, 459326, 26255, '<td valign="top">This seems to be a nude candid.  The pose itself is OK, but having the model looking into the camera and smiling really takes away from the image.  Maybe if the model were looking toward the lightsource, it would be better.</td>', 'This seems to be a nude candid.  The pose itself is OK, but having the model looking into the camera and smiling really takes away from the image.  Maybe if the model were looking toward the lightsource, it would be better.', '2007-01-31 13:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3308341, 459472, 26255, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Good control of lighting, interesting pose.  Great job!</td>', 'Very nice.  Good control of lighting, interesting pose.  Great job!', '2007-01-31 13:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3308346, 460469, 26255, '<td valign="top">The background in this shot is very busy with a mishmosh of colors.  This seems less of a nude and more of an editorial shot on what was offered at the local fair.</td>', 'The background in this shot is very busy with a mishmosh of colors.  This seems less of a nude and more of an editorial shot on what was offered at the local fair.', '2007-01-31 13:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3308350, 460478, 26255, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot!  Great perspective, pose, lighting.  Excellent idea and wonderful execution.</td>', 'Fantastic shot!  Great perspective, pose, lighting.  Excellent idea and wonderful execution.', '2007-01-31 13:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3308354, 460399, 26255, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot.  I like the use of lighting and pose.  Overall, good job.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot.  I like the use of lighting and pose.  Overall, good job.', '2007-01-31 13:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3308356, 460391, 26255, '<td valign="top">Nice take on a classic pose.  The focus seems a touch soft, but not so much that it becomes a distraction.</td>', 'Nice take on a classic pose.  The focus seems a touch soft, but not so much that it becomes a distraction.', '2007-01-31 13:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3308360, 459978, 26255, '<td valign="top">This is a decent shot, but nothing really jumps out and "makes" the image.  Overall, just kind of a ho-hum shot.</td>', 'This is a decent shot, but nothing really jumps out and "makes" the image.  Overall, just kind of a ho-hum shot.', '2007-01-31 13:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3308364, 459826, 26255, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and unique take on the challenge.</td>', 'Very interesting and unique take on the challenge.', '2007-01-31 13:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3308372, 460279, 26255, '<td valign="top">Certainly a beautiful shot, but a few things jump out at me.  The selective desaturation works well for this particular image, but the skins seem to be overly smooth.  I think you went a little heavy on the NeatImage. As far as the pose in concerned, the placement of the hands feels a little "forced".  The expression is great and the model is certainly beautiful, but the forced placement of the hands takes away from the overall "pensive" feel to her expression.</td>', 'Certainly a beautiful shot, but a few things jump out at me.  The selective desaturation works well for this particular image, but the skins seem to be overly smooth.  I think you went a little heavy on the NeatImage. As far as the pose in concerned, the placement of the hands feels a little "forced".  The expression is great and the model is certainly beautiful, but the forced placement of the hands takes away from the overall "pensive" feel to her expression.', '2007-01-31 13:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3308378, 460173, 26255, '<td valign="top">Nice candid shot.  I particularly like the chill bump textures you captured on your models skin.  Thank you for not smoothing those out, they really add to the image.</td>', 'Nice candid shot.  I particularly like the chill bump textures you captured on your models skin.  Thank you for not smoothing those out, they really add to the image.', '2007-01-31 13:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
