(3313244, 459643, 38127, '<td valign="top">Super cute pose, model looks a little tense (understandable its not everyday we sit in front of a camera trying to cover our bits ;) )  Only suggestions i''d offer at first glance (for what its worth coming from me)  is be aware of cutting off toes etc in the frame which i''m sure you''ve heard a zillion times so far and relaxing the shoulders goes miles in making a model appear more relaxed.  When we are tense we tend to draw them up around our necks.<br/> <br/>Really dig this tho, she is adorable as well.</td>', 'Super cute pose, model looks a little tense (understandable its not everyday we sit in front of a camera trying to cover our bits ;) )  Only suggestions i''d offer at first glance (for what its worth coming from me)  is be aware of cutting off toes etc in the frame which i''m sure you''ve heard a zillion times so far and relaxing the shoulders goes miles in making a model appear more relaxed.  When we are tense we tend to draw them up around our necks. Really dig this tho, she is adorable as well.', '2007-02-01 12:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313253, 460399, 38127, '<td valign="top">I like it because it offers a bit of a story to the viewer that we can all relate to.. not like a still life with a body as the subject. Lighting looks like it happened naturally when he sat up.. really dig it.</td>', 'I like it because it offers a bit of a story to the viewer that we can all relate to.. not like a still life with a body as the subject. Lighting looks like it happened naturally when he sat up.. really dig it.', '2007-02-01 12:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313310, 459559, 38127, '<td valign="top">Thing that appeals to me with this is the funky squares of coloured light. Pose is emotive and the colours soften that up a bit.. we''ve all been down the rabbit hole and this picture captures the mood beautifully yet it remains hopeful.  I love it.</td>', 'Thing that appeals to me with this is the funky squares of coloured light. Pose is emotive and the colours soften that up a bit.. we''ve all been down the rabbit hole and this picture captures the mood beautifully yet it remains hopeful.  I love it.', '2007-02-01 13:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313381, 460119, 38127, '<td valign="top">I really like this image it has an ethereal feel to it, but that very same thing is what gave me pause to begin with..at first it felt too smooth (neat imaged maybe?) <br/>I kept coming back to it and spending time really trying to discover why it appealed and or didnt. May I just say now (of course I may i''m the one typing afterall lol)  that "Art" should make the viewer stop and question what it is they like or dont like, how it moves them, relatedness to our lives or not.. so many things and out of all the images in the challenge..that is what yours did for me.  Bravo for that. <br/> <br/>The pose is sincere, lighting is great. Would have liked to see the warmer tones brought into the back and head/face a bit more. <br/> <br/>Well done I hope you do well :)</td>', 'I really like this image it has an ethereal feel to it, but that very same thing is what gave me pause to begin with..at first it felt too smooth (neat imaged maybe?) I kept coming back to it and spending time really trying to discover why it appealed and or didnt. May I just say now (of course I may i''m the one typing afterall lol)  that "Art" should make the viewer stop and question what it is they like or dont like, how it moves them, relatedness to our lives or not.. so many things and out of all the images in the challenge..that is what yours did for me.  Bravo for that.  The pose is sincere, lighting is great. Would have liked to see the warmer tones brought into the back and head/face a bit more.  Well done I hope you do well :)', '2007-02-01 13:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313388, 460391, 38127, '<td valign="top">I know this is posed, but it feels like it could be a real moment not that someone is posing nude and trying to hide their face. <br/> <br/>The long hair hanging perfectly imperfect is a really nice touch, I like the framing of the subject <br/> <br/>well done.</td>', 'I know this is posed, but it feels like it could be a real moment not that someone is posing nude and trying to hide their face.  The long hair hanging perfectly imperfect is a really nice touch, I like the framing of the subject  well done.', '2007-02-01 13:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313402, 460476, 38127, '<td valign="top">Its the crop / framing of the subject matter that gives me pause.. someone explained to me how hard it is to get a good bathtub from above shot and still have it appear artistic.. Model of course is very beautiful but would have perhaps gotten a higher score from me if it were framed differently.. the entire tub, different angle maybe.. still very well done.</td>', 'Its the crop / framing of the subject matter that gives me pause.. someone explained to me how hard it is to get a good bathtub from above shot and still have it appear artistic.. Model of course is very beautiful but would have perhaps gotten a higher score from me if it were framed differently.. the entire tub, different angle maybe.. still very well done.', '2007-02-01 13:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
