(3313463, 459643, 26255, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  The only thing I don''t like is how your models feet are chopped off on the bottom of the frame and she seems a little "stiff".  Perhaps if she had relaxed her shoulders a bit more, it would seem more natural and less like she is trying to "cover up".  I like the use of negative space on the right, but it like it''s cropped a smidge too tight on the left side.  Nice use of lighting and post processing.  I even like the soft shadow behind the model.</td>', 'Very nice image.  The only thing I don''t like is how your models feet are chopped off on the bottom of the frame and she seems a little "stiff".  Perhaps if she had relaxed her shoulders a bit more, it would seem more natural and less like she is trying to "cover up".  I like the use of negative space on the right, but it like it''s cropped a smidge too tight on the left side.  Nice use of lighting and post processing.  I even like the soft shadow behind the model.', '2007-02-01 13:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
