(3313494, 460260, 26255, '<td valign="top">Very nice image and great use of lighting.  The shoe is a bit of a distraction and the crop is a little too tight on the right side for my taste.</td>', 'Very nice image and great use of lighting.  The shoe is a bit of a distraction and the crop is a little too tight on the right side for my taste.', '2007-02-01 13:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313500, 460329, 26255, '<td valign="top">Brave and very telling shot!</td>', 'Brave and very telling shot!', '2007-02-01 13:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313675, 460159, 48389, '<td valign="top">I really like the light here and your editing works nicely. The only thing I am not too keen on is the material strewn over the stairs. The image has a relaxed feel to it but with the material on the stairs it takes to to too setup....just my opinion! Still a great shot! :o)</td>', 'I really like the light here and your editing works nicely. The only thing I am not too keen on is the material strewn over the stairs. The image has a relaxed feel to it but with the material on the stairs it takes to to too setup....just my opinion! Still a great shot! :o)', '2007-02-01 14:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313683, 459614, 48389, '<td valign="top">I like the expression on the models face but the pose just looks uncomfortable and the lighting is too dull for me.</td>', 'I like the expression on the models face but the pose just looks uncomfortable and the lighting is too dull for me.', '2007-02-01 14:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313691, 459299, 48389, '<td valign="top">This would have been a lovely photo if it weren''t for those glass ''things''. They are so distracting and I just don''t understand the position of them. I also don''t like the darkening around the models foot.</td>', 'This would have been a lovely photo if it weren''t for those glass ''things''. They are so distracting and I just don''t understand the position of them. I also don''t like the darkening around the models foot.', '2007-02-01 14:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313704, 457824, 48389, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and composition but I am not too sure about the expression on the models face</td>', 'Nice lighting and composition but I am not too sure about the expression on the models face', '2007-02-01 14:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313721, 460142, 48389, '<td valign="top">I know this probably shouldn''t be what I like the most but hey! The flooring is great in this shot!! lol I really like it. Nice position of the chair in the frame and the pose is good. The only thing I don''t like are the shoes. I''d prefer this to have a more relaxed feel but with the shoes it doesn''t quite work (Just my humble opinion)</td>', 'I know this probably shouldn''t be what I like the most but hey! The flooring is great in this shot!! lol I really like it. Nice position of the chair in the frame and the pose is good. The only thing I don''t like are the shoes. I''d prefer this to have a more relaxed feel but with the shoes it doesn''t quite work (Just my humble opinion)', '2007-02-01 14:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313744, 460469, 48389, '<td valign="top">Interesting work of art and nice use of DOF :o)</td>', 'Interesting work of art and nice use of DOF :o)', '2007-02-01 14:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313754, 460470, 48389, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and you have managed the lighting well :o) The image looks a bit pixelated on my screen though?</td>', 'Interesting idea and you have managed the lighting well :o) The image looks a bit pixelated on my screen though?', '2007-02-01 14:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313761, 460102, 48389, '<td valign="top">I love the models pose and the lighting but I am really not sure about the ''design'' on her back</td>', 'I love the models pose and the lighting but I am really not sure about the ''design'' on her back', '2007-02-01 14:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313775, 460210, 48389, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I understand this shot. The lighting doesn''t look quite right. On the top right, around the elbow there is either some bad editing or the background isn''t covering the whole area the model took up. Also, for me, I would like to see the whole of the model in focus, as it is I am struggling to find a point of focus (just my humble opinion)</td>', 'I don''t think I understand this shot. The lighting doesn''t look quite right. On the top right, around the elbow there is either some bad editing or the background isn''t covering the whole area the model took up. Also, for me, I would like to see the whole of the model in focus, as it is I am struggling to find a point of focus (just my humble opinion)', '2007-02-01 14:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313797, 460260, 48389, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and I love the position of the model in the frame but the lighting is a little too dull for me</td>', 'Nice idea and I love the position of the model in the frame but the lighting is a little too dull for me', '2007-02-01 14:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313804, 460107, 48389, '<td valign="top">I really don''t get your editing here! It just doesn''t suit the overall image at all (just my humble opinion)</td>', 'I really don''t get your editing here! It just doesn''t suit the overall image at all (just my humble opinion)', '2007-02-01 14:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313813, 460047, 48389, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, not a very original idea but I''m sure you have racked up plenty of views :o) The models right arm doesn''t look very comfortable but the image is nice and sharp and I like your choice of B&amp;W</td>', 'Nice composition, not a very original idea but I''m sure you have racked up plenty of views :o) The models right arm doesn''t look very comfortable but the image is nice and sharp and I like your choice of B&W', '2007-02-01 14:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313906, 460461, 64352, '<td valign="top">THIS is a very fun photo</td>', 'THIS is a very fun photo', '2007-02-01 15:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313912, 460391, 48389, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and I like the pose. Not sure about the editing on the left side of the frame and I would say you broke one of the golden rules.....I can see the mark of where the models socks were!! lol</td>', 'Nice lighting and I like the pose. Not sure about the editing on the left side of the frame and I would say you broke one of the golden rules.....I can see the mark of where the models socks were!! lol', '2007-02-01 15:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313913, 460186, 64352, '<td valign="top">I love the post in this shot.</td>', 'I love the post in this shot.', '2007-02-01 15:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313922, 460420, 64352, '<td valign="top">Only thing i do not like about this image is the downward turn of the corner of her mouth. It seems to bring a less elegant mood to the image. Everything else is spot on.</td>', 'Only thing i do not like about this image is the downward turn of the corner of her mouth. It seems to bring a less elegant mood to the image. Everything else is spot on.', '2007-02-01 15:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313932, 460450, 64352, '<td valign="top">I like the photo. The hard shadowing actually works for this image. But... why is she sitting on a chest of drawers throws me...</td>', 'I like the photo. The hard shadowing actually works for this image. But... why is she sitting on a chest of drawers throws me...', '2007-02-01 15:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313934, 457097, 64352, '<td valign="top">I hope you share your post work on this... i''d really love to see how this was done.</td>', 'I hope you share your post work on this... i''d really love to see how this was done.', '2007-02-01 15:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313947, 457824, 64352, '<td valign="top">you know what i like most is that if you look closely you realize she has nipple rings as well as a french manicure. Nice touches. Lighting is very nice and sets the right mood and emphasis... I also like that the background is not distracting.</td>', 'you know what i like most is that if you look closely you realize she has nipple rings as well as a french manicure. Nice touches. Lighting is very nice and sets the right mood and emphasis... I also like that the background is not distracting.', '2007-02-01 15:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3313951, 458769, 64352, '<td valign="top">Hey! I didn''t say she could wear my shirt!</td>', 'Hey! I didn''t say she could wear my shirt!', '2007-02-01 15:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314075, 460279, 57456, '<td valign="top">Very well done and added to my favorites. I really like the softness of her skin in this photo. The red really adds to the overall effect. IMHO, a very good job in finding such a flattering pose.</td>', 'Very well done and added to my favorites. I really like the softness of her skin in this photo. The red really adds to the overall effect. IMHO, a very good job in finding such a flattering pose.', '2007-02-01 15:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314082, 459528, 57456, '<td valign="top">The model seems a little less than thrilled to be there, but that only adds to the overall effect of your photograph. Stunning woman and very easy on the eyes.</td>', 'The model seems a little less than thrilled to be there, but that only adds to the overall effect of your photograph. Stunning woman and very easy on the eyes.', '2007-02-01 15:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314087, 460475, 57456, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite types of photographs which I some day hope to become good at. With photos like this, I am motivated to keep trying.</td>', 'This is one of my favorite types of photographs which I some day hope to become good at. With photos like this, I am motivated to keep trying.', '2007-02-01 15:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314094, 457276, 57456, '<td valign="top">I am always impressed when I see a photograph, specifically a beautiful woman done with this style of photography. I hope to someday learn this technique and with people like you...I am learning a great deal.</td>', 'I am always impressed when I see a photograph, specifically a beautiful woman done with this style of photography. I hope to someday learn this technique and with people like you...I am learning a great deal.', '2007-02-01 15:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314128, 460140, 40679, '<td valign="top">nice setting for a photo like this. <br/> <br/>I think ''d like the eye looking to the cam more, you can see a lot of white of the eyes now.</td>', 'nice setting for a photo like this.  I think ''d like the eye looking to the cam more, you can see a lot of white of the eyes now.', '2007-02-01 15:55:59.000000', NULL, 1);
