(3314396, 460380, 2240, '<td valign="top">Nice job. I feel that you have every thing right. The only thing is, I find that the lemons are a little distracting. Maybe if there was not as many or something. Who knows six of one, half a dozen of another. I''m sure that one person will tell you one thing, and another will tell you something else. Good Luck.  9</td>', 'Nice job. I feel that you have every thing right. The only thing is, I find that the lemons are a little distracting. Maybe if there was not as many or something. Who knows six of one, half a dozen of another. I''m sure that one person will tell you one thing, and another will tell you something else. Good Luck.  9', '2007-02-01 16:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314399, 460157, 40679, '<td valign="top">seems like a bit too much neat image, compo and pose look fine. would love to see more of her face.</td>', 'seems like a bit too much neat image, compo and pose look fine. would love to see more of her face.', '2007-02-01 16:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
