(3314419, 460341, 2240, '<td valign="top">I must say I do like this. The feel of it is great. The lighting, colours, and focus is perfect. I would have like to see a little more of the body, but still tastefully done. Good Luck</td>', 'I must say I do like this. The feel of it is great. The lighting, colours, and focus is perfect. I would have like to see a little more of the body, but still tastefully done. Good Luck', '2007-02-01 17:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
