(3314687, 460136, 67612, '<td valign="top">I can''t say that I like the placement of the hat to cover the entire face.  I think it would have been better to at least see the lips.  I do like the limited colors.</td>', 'I can''t say that I like the placement of the hat to cover the entire face.  I think it would have been better to at least see the lips.  I do like the limited colors.', '2007-02-01 18:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314696, 458769, 67612, '<td valign="top">I love the pose and the lighting.  The beautiful model doesn''t hurt either.  Love it.</td>', 'I love the pose and the lighting.  The beautiful model doesn''t hurt either.  Love it.', '2007-02-01 18:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314847, 460054, 68270, '<td valign="top">so funny :)</td>', 'so funny :)', '2007-02-01 18:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315303, 460235, 26255, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting image.  The image itself is OK on it''s own, but the agressive post processing makes this almost abstract.</td>', 'This is a very interesting image.  The image itself is OK on it''s own, but the agressive post processing makes this almost abstract.', '2007-02-01 20:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315312, 458330, 26255, '<td valign="top">A sweet an innocent portrayal of feminine beauty.  Good job on the image, I think I would prefer to see a 3/4 shot of the model rather than cropping at the waist.</td>', 'A sweet an innocent portrayal of feminine beauty.  Good job on the image, I think I would prefer to see a 3/4 shot of the model rather than cropping at the waist.', '2007-02-01 20:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315322, 460195, 26255, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and interesting pose/composition.  I think it''s interesting to note that your title fits this pose perfectly, but if the model were to drop his head, the image could take on an entirely different meaning.</td>', 'Good lighting and interesting pose/composition.  I think it''s interesting to note that your title fits this pose perfectly, but if the model were to drop his head, the image could take on an entirely different meaning.', '2007-02-01 20:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315330, 458708, 26255, '<td valign="top">A very soft image and the eyes are haunting.  I really like the low-key feel to this, but for me, the title doesn''t quite fit.  The image by itself is very good.</td>', 'A very soft image and the eyes are haunting.  I really like the low-key feel to this, but for me, the title doesn''t quite fit.  The image by itself is very good.', '2007-02-01 20:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315342, 460140, 26255, '<td valign="top">There is a contradiction in this image for me.  The model seems to be relaxing, but her expression is one of distraction.  The post-processing takes on almost a grunge feeling which doesn''t tie in with the message you are trying to portray.  On the other hand, it is this contradiction that draws you more into the image and makes the viewer wonder... "What''s on her mind?"</td>', 'There is a contradiction in this image for me.  The model seems to be relaxing, but her expression is one of distraction.  The post-processing takes on almost a grunge feeling which doesn''t tie in with the message you are trying to portray.  On the other hand, it is this contradiction that draws you more into the image and makes the viewer wonder... "What''s on her mind?"', '2007-02-01 20:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315347, 459524, 26255, '<td valign="top">A sweet and simple nude... almost cliche''... I''m not a fan of the selective desaturation in this case.</td>', 'A sweet and simple nude... almost cliche''... I''m not a fan of the selective desaturation in this case.', '2007-02-01 20:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315374, 460428, 26255, '<td valign="top">A very nice figure study and an interesting silhouette, but something seems a bit offish.  I think maybe it''s the light catching the back of her neck right beside her right arm and the light on her left arm and thumb.  This is potentially a very good shot, but the pose could be improved I think.</td>', 'A very nice figure study and an interesting silhouette, but something seems a bit offish.  I think maybe it''s the light catching the back of her neck right beside her right arm and the light on her left arm and thumb.  This is potentially a very good shot, but the pose could be improved I think.', '2007-02-01 20:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315402, 460107, 26255, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is very harsh and the pose uninteresting.  I''m assuming (based on your title) that you are doing a parallel to Leonard Da Vinci''s "Vitruvian Man".  The only thing that leads the viewer to this conclusion is the title.  The background totally removes any indication of what you are attempting.  Perhaps if this was shot on a white background and done in a high key nature and then toned down in post-processing with some sepia tones, you could better achieve your vision.</td>', 'The lighting on this is very harsh and the pose uninteresting.  I''m assuming (based on your title) that you are doing a parallel to Leonard Da Vinci''s "Vitruvian Man".  The only thing that leads the viewer to this conclusion is the title.  The background totally removes any indication of what you are attempting.  Perhaps if this was shot on a white background and done in a high key nature and then toned down in post-processing with some sepia tones, you could better achieve your vision.', '2007-02-01 20:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315419, 460380, 26255, '<td valign="top">LOL... this is probably the most entertaining image I''ve seen in this challenge.  The lemons are well chosen.  I particularly like the pierced lemon.  Bravo!!!</td>', 'LOL... this is probably the most entertaining image I''ve seen in this challenge.  The lemons are well chosen.  I particularly like the pierced lemon.  Bravo!!!', '2007-02-01 20:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315430, 457097, 26255, '<td valign="top">Something about this image strikes me as a bit odd.  It seems very artificial and I can''t explain why.</td>', 'Something about this image strikes me as a bit odd.  It seems very artificial and I can''t explain why.', '2007-02-01 20:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315441, 460456, 26255, '<td valign="top">Excellent take on the challenge.  I really like the way you have "boxed" in your model with perfect cropping.  I would like to see more contrast.</td>', 'Excellent take on the challenge.  I really like the way you have "boxed" in your model with perfect cropping.  I would like to see more contrast.', '2007-02-01 20:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
