(3315666, 460153, 26255, '<td valign="top">Excellent job!!!  I love this image on so many different levels.  The pose and lighting are damn near perfect.  The subject matter is beautiful and the statement is very powerful.  The only tiniest nitpick I have is what appears to be a sock or dark fabric on your male models "bits".  I understand why you''ve done this, but I think that slightly more careful placement of your female models right arm would have made for better "concealment".</td>', 'Excellent job!!!  I love this image on so many different levels.  The pose and lighting are damn near perfect.  The subject matter is beautiful and the statement is very powerful.  The only tiniest nitpick I have is what appears to be a sock or dark fabric on your male models "bits".  I understand why you''ve done this, but I think that slightly more careful placement of your female models right arm would have made for better "concealment".', '2007-02-01 21:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
