(3315699, 460450, 26255, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite subjects.  The lighting is a bit harsh and I''m not a fan of the background.  I prefer to see maternity photography with softer lighting, more muted colors (preferably black and white), and simple poses.  My personal belief is that in maternity photography, the main focus of the image should be the bond the mother has with her unborn child.  Too many props, colors, etc take away from this meaning.</td>', 'This is one of my favorite subjects.  The lighting is a bit harsh and I''m not a fan of the background.  I prefer to see maternity photography with softer lighting, more muted colors (preferably black and white), and simple poses.  My personal belief is that in maternity photography, the main focus of the image should be the bond the mother has with her unborn child.  Too many props, colors, etc take away from this meaning.', '2007-02-01 21:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315716, 460039, 26255, '<td valign="top">This has soooooo much potential.  I love the message, the title, the pose.  I''m not a fan of the lighting, background, or foreground.  I would love to see this exact image shot on a black background with a keylight that highlights the cross and really drives your point home... You''ve inspired me to play around with this theme.</td>', 'This has soooooo much potential.  I love the message, the title, the pose.  I''m not a fan of the lighting, background, or foreground.  I would love to see this exact image shot on a black background with a keylight that highlights the cross and really drives your point home... You''ve inspired me to play around with this theme.', '2007-02-01 21:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
