(3318175, 456935, 26255, '<td valign="top">Cute tribute.  I''m afraid you may receive some low votes since this is not a "true nude".</td>', 'Cute tribute.  I''m afraid you may receive some low votes since this is not a "true nude".', '2007-02-02 10:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3318178, 459528, 26255, '<td valign="top">Well lit and good expression from your model.  It''s very sultry in an almost accidental way.</td>', 'Well lit and good expression from your model.  It''s very sultry in an almost accidental way.', '2007-02-02 10:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3318185, 460423, 26255, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract.  I applaud your efforts to go against the mainstream.  While this image does not suit my personal taste, I see great merit in the shot and can appreciate it for the artwork that it is.  Very "Andy Warholesque".  Kudos!</td>', 'Interesting abstract.  I applaud your efforts to go against the mainstream.  While this image does not suit my personal taste, I see great merit in the shot and can appreciate it for the artwork that it is.  Very "Andy Warholesque".  Kudos!', '2007-02-02 10:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3318189, 460459, 26255, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but feel the execution falls slightly short.  I think I would prefer to see the "surveillance screen" in black and white to strengthen the concept.</td>', 'I like the idea, but feel the execution falls slightly short.  I think I would prefer to see the "surveillance screen" in black and white to strengthen the concept.', '2007-02-02 10:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3318191, 459466, 26255, '<td valign="top">Very spooky image.  I like the concept and execution.  The pink rimlight was a nice choice.</td>', 'Very spooky image.  I like the concept and execution.  The pink rimlight was a nice choice.', '2007-02-02 10:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3318208, 459808, 26255, '<td valign="top">A very interesting spin on the challenge.  A bit of a comedic look on the original sin.  Personally I''m not a huge fan of this for several reasons, but the idea does have merit.  I''m afraid you''ll get some low votes since this is not a "true nude".</td>', 'A very interesting spin on the challenge.  A bit of a comedic look on the original sin.  Personally I''m not a huge fan of this for several reasons, but the idea does have merit.  I''m afraid you''ll get some low votes since this is not a "true nude".', '2007-02-02 10:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3318210, 459540, 26255, '<td valign="top">Very nice image of an intimate moment captured in a delicate and tasteful way.  The warm tones add much to the image and I''m glad you didn''t try to go with a stereotypical black and white.</td>', 'Very nice image of an intimate moment captured in a delicate and tasteful way.  The warm tones add much to the image and I''m glad you didn''t try to go with a stereotypical black and white.', '2007-02-02 10:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3318218, 460036, 26255, '<td valign="top">I like the concept but feel the execution falls a little short.  The post processing is nice, and I don''t really mind the color.  The crackled texture drives home your attempt, but the pose is somewhat lacking.  The smile and head position don''t really work for me.  The pose seems a little forced probably due to the stiff elbow.  I would also recommend when going for a vintage feel, remove what appears to be a watch from your model.  The interjection of modern accessories take away from the feel of the image.</td>', 'I like the concept but feel the execution falls a little short.  The post processing is nice, and I don''t really mind the color.  The crackled texture drives home your attempt, but the pose is somewhat lacking.  The smile and head position don''t really work for me.  The pose seems a little forced probably due to the stiff elbow.  I would also recommend when going for a vintage feel, remove what appears to be a watch from your model.  The interjection of modern accessories take away from the feel of the image.', '2007-02-02 10:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3318226, 458674, 26255, '<td valign="top">Nice capture but I feel this particular image may benefit from a "darker mood".  A black background would help but I would not change the lighting a bit.  Good job on lighting, focus seems a little soft.</td>', 'Nice capture but I feel this particular image may benefit from a "darker mood".  A black background would help but I would not change the lighting a bit.  Good job on lighting, focus seems a little soft.', '2007-02-02 10:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3318233, 460215, 26255, '<td valign="top">I really like this image, particularly the simplicity of the pose and the duality of the title.  The color works well, but the focus seems a bit off and there is some visible noise.  The soft focus would work without the noise and the noise would work without the soft focus but the two combined take away from the image IMHO.</td>', 'I really like this image, particularly the simplicity of the pose and the duality of the title.  The color works well, but the focus seems a bit off and there is some visible noise.  The soft focus would work without the noise and the noise would work without the soft focus but the two combined take away from the image IMHO.', '2007-02-02 10:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3318234, 459559, 26255, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.  The models expression is perfect and I love the processing treatment you have done.  Good job!</td>', 'Very nice capture.  The models expression is perfect and I love the processing treatment you have done.  Good job!', '2007-02-02 10:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3318241, 460136, 26255, '<td valign="top">The lighting is certainly nice, but the pose does nothing for me.  I understand why you''ve done the selective desaturation and the concept might work under different circumstances but the way it is, I''m left wondering why is the "Lady in Red" lying on the ground in what appears to be a "hold up" position and a hat on her face?</td>', 'The lighting is certainly nice, but the pose does nothing for me.  I understand why you''ve done the selective desaturation and the concept might work under different circumstances but the way it is, I''m left wondering why is the "Lady in Red" lying on the ground in what appears to be a "hold up" position and a hat on her face?', '2007-02-02 11:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3318243, 460476, 26255, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Beautiful model, great pose, spot on lighting, great composition, love the background!!!  That is all.</td>', 'Wow!  Beautiful model, great pose, spot on lighting, great composition, love the background!!!  That is all.', '2007-02-02 11:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3318257, 459764, 26255, '<td valign="top">This is a very unique image and I think you''ve pulled off a difficult shot splendidly.  The lighting is wonderful and the statement is very compelling.  I even kind of like the purplish background although I think I might prefer a simple black do draw more attention to the subject.  The hair, back, and arm on the model appear to be "blocky" on my monitor and may suffer from resizing problems and/or overprocessing of some sort.  Other than that... GREAT JOB!!!  Very creative!!!</td>', 'This is a very unique image and I think you''ve pulled off a difficult shot splendidly.  The lighting is wonderful and the statement is very compelling.  I even kind of like the purplish background although I think I might prefer a simple black do draw more attention to the subject.  The hair, back, and arm on the model appear to be "blocky" on my monitor and may suffer from resizing problems and/or overprocessing of some sort.  Other than that... GREAT JOB!!!  Very creative!!!', '2007-02-02 11:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3318258, 459874, 26255, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting.  I love the DOF and color.  The gradient background works wonderfully.</td>', 'Excellent lighting.  I love the DOF and color.  The gradient background works wonderfully.', '2007-02-02 11:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3318263, 460474, 26255, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but there are a few dislikes.  The contrast is too subdued for my taste and I''m not a fan of the "grainy" feel.  The background and foreground seem to be dodged in and give your model a dark halo.  It seems as if you are going for a "dreamy" feel on an image that looks more like a stock photography shot for a day spa.  I think it''s that conflict that doesn''t do this image the justice it deserves.</td>', 'I like the idea but there are a few dislikes.  The contrast is too subdued for my taste and I''m not a fan of the "grainy" feel.  The background and foreground seem to be dodged in and give your model a dark halo.  It seems as if you are going for a "dreamy" feel on an image that looks more like a stock photography shot for a day spa.  I think it''s that conflict that doesn''t do this image the justice it deserves.', '2007-02-02 11:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3318315, 458943, 26255, '<td valign="top">The flash is very overpowering and the grain and lack of contrast also take away from the image as a whole.  The crop is too tight and the selective desaturation does nothing for me.  I''m sorry if this seems overly harsh, but it is my honest opinion.  I would recommend not using an on camera flash for shots of this nature and experiment more with proper lighting techniques.  The duality of the title is very nice but I''m not a fan of the image itself.</td>', 'The flash is very overpowering and the grain and lack of contrast also take away from the image as a whole.  The crop is too tight and the selective desaturation does nothing for me.  I''m sorry if this seems overly harsh, but it is my honest opinion.  I would recommend not using an on camera flash for shots of this nature and experiment more with proper lighting techniques.  The duality of the title is very nice but I''m not a fan of the image itself.', '2007-02-02 11:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3318903, 460153, 32378, '<td valign="top">Fantastic work, great lighting and contrast.  A 10 all the way.</td>', 'Fantastic work, great lighting and contrast.  A 10 all the way.', '2007-02-02 13:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3318906, 460157, 32378, '<td valign="top">Wonderful and beautiful shot.  I like the soft feel of this, great lighting.</td>', 'Wonderful and beautiful shot.  I like the soft feel of this, great lighting.', '2007-02-02 14:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3318913, 460047, 32378, '<td valign="top">Great shot, liked the shutter speed you used to show the movement of the water yet not overly blurred.  My only other comment is on the possition of the back arm, looks a tad awkward from the angle of the shot.</td>', 'Great shot, liked the shutter speed you used to show the movement of the water yet not overly blurred.  My only other comment is on the possition of the back arm, looks a tad awkward from the angle of the shot.', '2007-02-02 14:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
