(3319112, 459540, 27767, '<td valign="top">I love the horizontal flow of this image. I think the warm lighting is excellent and the composition is absolutely perfect. I think the hand serves very well as a primary point of focus. The border looks great too. Excellent job.</td>', 'I love the horizontal flow of this image. I think the warm lighting is excellent and the composition is absolutely perfect. I think the hand serves very well as a primary point of focus. The border looks great too. Excellent job.', '2007-02-02 14:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3319118, 460153, 27767, '<td valign="top">Masterful! The lighting is so excellent in this image. At first the shot felt a little out of balance to me, but the more I look at it, it is alright. I think the poses are great and the background is well chosen. The full range of tones in this image really looks great. Amazing job.</td>', 'Masterful! The lighting is so excellent in this image. At first the shot felt a little out of balance to me, but the more I look at it, it is alright. I think the poses are great and the background is well chosen. The full range of tones in this image really looks great. Amazing job.', '2007-02-02 14:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
