(3321620, 460341, 11467, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and great image. I find the image overall a tiny bit dark and I think it is cropped too tightly at the bottom. Showing a bit of the legs or even the entire legs would greatly improve the image. 8</td>', 'Great idea, and great image. I find the image overall a tiny bit dark and I think it is cropped too tightly at the bottom. Showing a bit of the legs or even the entire legs would greatly improve the image. 8', '2007-02-03 02:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
