(3323717, 460482, 40679, '<td valign="top">I like the way the eye gets attention, but her breasts are in the full light, so my attention goes there very fast.</td>', 'I like the way the eye gets attention, but her breasts are in the full light, so my attention goes there very fast.', '2007-02-03 17:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
