(3323725, 458637, 40679, '<td valign="top">too bad the focus isn''t on her face. a bit too busy with the hearts and the white stuff.</td>', 'too bad the focus isn''t on her face. a bit too busy with the hearts and the white stuff.', '2007-02-03 17:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3323727, 460210, 40679, '<td valign="top">I really miss some real focus here</td>', 'I really miss some real focus here', '2007-02-03 17:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3323733, 460341, 40679, '<td valign="top">hm the title doesn''t really fit the mood of the photo. I think this would be awesome in black and white and a little bit more post processing.</td>', 'hm the title doesn''t really fit the mood of the photo. I think this would be awesome in black and white and a little bit more post processing.', '2007-02-03 17:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3323735, 460039, 69102, '<td valign="top">The pose and the idea is actually not bad. Lighting, exposure and composition, however, need work. The presence of the carpet and baseboard is distracting, and doesn''t add anything to the image. Also, on my monitor at least, the picture is very dark with very little detail or texture (sorta muddy). Try this one again with a neutral backdrop (and even some experimentation with lighting) and you could have something really interesting.</td>', 'The pose and the idea is actually not bad. Lighting, exposure and composition, however, need work. The presence of the carpet and baseboard is distracting, and doesn''t add anything to the image. Also, on my monitor at least, the picture is very dark with very little detail or texture (sorta muddy). Try this one again with a neutral backdrop (and even some experimentation with lighting) and you could have something really interesting.', '2007-02-03 17:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3323738, 459780, 69102, '<td valign="top">Very evocative. Nice composition and lighting.</td>', 'Very evocative. Nice composition and lighting.', '2007-02-03 17:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3323740, 458674, 40679, '<td valign="top">this could be an awesome artsy photo, but I miss sharpness and it seems like you messed up a bit in post processing. the skin isn''t "smooth" anymore (don''t know how to say it different)</td>', 'this could be an awesome artsy photo, but I miss sharpness and it seems like you messed up a bit in post processing. the skin isn''t "smooth" anymore (don''t know how to say it different)', '2007-02-03 17:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3323742, 460482, 69102, '<td valign="top">Nice. Like the lighting and the composition. The pose is also very fun while still carrying an abstract quality. Wish the DOF was a little deeper.</td>', 'Nice. Like the lighting and the composition. The pose is also very fun while still carrying an abstract quality. Wish the DOF was a little deeper.', '2007-02-03 17:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3323743, 460476, 69102, '<td valign="top">Great composition, and a fun shot. I know the bubbles on the breasts were probably intended for the sake of modesty, but for me they actually work to make the shot less artistic and more men''s magazine.</td>', 'Great composition, and a fun shot. I know the bubbles on the breasts were probably intended for the sake of modesty, but for me they actually work to make the shot less artistic and more men''s magazine.', '2007-02-03 17:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3323744, 460386, 69102, '<td valign="top">Fun shot and a nice pose. I wish the lighting wasn''t quite so harsh.</td>', 'Fun shot and a nice pose. I wish the lighting wasn''t quite so harsh.', '2007-02-03 17:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3323746, 460456, 40679, '<td valign="top">this could also work for fill the frame ;)<br/> <br/>I think b/w would also be very nice.</td>', 'this could also work for fill the frame ;) I think b/w would also be very nice.', '2007-02-03 17:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3323750, 459504, 69102, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Very good composition and exposure. It may be my monitor, but I wish there was a little more texture/detail in the dark area of her hair and that it stood out more from the dark background. Also the way she is resting her cheek on her arm detracts from her otherwise good expression. Wish the eyes weren''t purple.</td>', 'Nicely done. Very good composition and exposure. It may be my monitor, but I wish there was a little more texture/detail in the dark area of her hair and that it stood out more from the dark background. Also the way she is resting her cheek on her arm detracts from her otherwise good expression. Wish the eyes weren''t purple.', '2007-02-03 17:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3323751, 460338, 40679, '<td valign="top">the sharpness looks a bit weird here, I don''t think you could do this with a normal DoF (but I could be wrong ofcourse ;))<br/> <br/>the crop is a bit too tight for me at the top. I keep looking at the eyes!</td>', 'the sharpness looks a bit weird here, I don''t think you could do this with a normal DoF (but I could be wrong ofcourse ;)) the crop is a bit too tight for me at the top. I keep looking at the eyes!', '2007-02-03 17:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3323753, 459614, 40679, '<td valign="top">aah that is so sweet! looks like a babyboy ;)<br/> <br/>overall the photo seems to need a bit more brightness, but for the rest it looks ok.<br/> <br/></td>', 'aah that is so sweet! looks like a babyboy ;) overall the photo seems to need a bit more brightness, but for the rest it looks ok. ', '2007-02-03 17:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3323757, 460420, 40679, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that you added her face in the photo, this really works for me. not sure about the shoulder.<br/> <br/>focus and lighting look very nice!</td>', 'I like the fact that you added her face in the photo, this really works for me. not sure about the shoulder. focus and lighting look very nice!', '2007-02-03 17:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3323758, 460054, 69102, '<td valign="top">Hah! :)</td>', 'Hah! :)', '2007-02-03 17:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3323759, 460047, 69102, '<td valign="top">Nice. Left wondering what a slightly longer exposure would have looked liked, giving the water (and the shot) a softer look and effect.</td>', 'Nice. Left wondering what a slightly longer exposure would have looked liked, giving the water (and the shot) a softer look and effect.', '2007-02-03 17:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3323760, 459556, 40679, '<td valign="top">her face looks a bit pixelated.. <br/> <br/>love the pose, not sure about the kimono like that, looks a little bit messy.</td>', 'her face looks a bit pixelated..  love the pose, not sure about the kimono like that, looks a little bit messy.', '2007-02-03 17:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3323763, 459466, 40679, '<td valign="top">the red and magenta tones are a bit too much for me. and I''m not quite sure what to think of the mask above her head.</td>', 'the red and magenta tones are a bit too much for me. and I''m not quite sure what to think of the mask above her head.', '2007-02-03 17:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3323765, 460329, 69102, '<td valign="top">I''m really trying not to react to this on a purely aesthetic level, because I understand that a "pretty" picture was not your intention. But I still think this falls short on a couple of points: First, I think this would have been a more interesting and more powerful without the heavy-handed post processing. Second, while I think you intentionally wanted a stark and straightforward composition, the composition on this could still be improved. I would have either liked to have seen something tighter, or a more full-body shot (or perhaps even just without the arms on the side so that there was negative space all the way up both sides). All that said, I''ve bumped up my rating. If nothing else, you deserve something for entering a shot that has such a likely chance of getting panned.</td>', 'I''m really trying not to react to this on a purely aesthetic level, because I understand that a "pretty" picture was not your intention. But I still think this falls short on a couple of points: First, I think this would have been a more interesting and more powerful without the heavy-handed post processing. Second, while I think you intentionally wanted a stark and straightforward composition, the composition on this could still be improved. I would have either liked to have seen something tighter, or a more full-body shot (or perhaps even just without the arms on the side so that there was negative space all the way up both sides). All that said, I''ve bumped up my rating. If nothing else, you deserve something for entering a shot that has such a likely chance of getting panned.', '2007-02-03 17:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3323769, 459559, 69102, '<td valign="top">Every time I look at this I adjust my initial rating up. A very powerful image.</td>', 'Every time I look at this I adjust my initial rating up. A very powerful image.', '2007-02-03 17:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3323779, 460470, 69102, '<td valign="top">While I think the geometry, color and light effect of the pool is interesting, the background is distracting and the nude gets lost in the composition. A tigher shot, or perhaps a steeper angle (if possible) would have worked better. Also, if the figure was floating, swimming, or perhaps completely under the water in some other pose this might have been better.</td>', 'While I think the geometry, color and light effect of the pool is interesting, the background is distracting and the nude gets lost in the composition. A tigher shot, or perhaps a steeper angle (if possible) would have worked better. Also, if the figure was floating, swimming, or perhaps completely under the water in some other pose this might have been better.', '2007-02-03 17:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3323783, 460338, 69102, '<td valign="top">The shallow dof doesn''t work here for me. If the legs had been in focus too I think you would have had a very sculptural effect.</td>', 'The shallow dof doesn''t work here for me. If the legs had been in focus too I think you would have had a very sculptural effect.', '2007-02-03 17:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
