(3326484, 460322, 56658, '<td valign="top">interesting shot. I like the lighting here and the fishnet is a nice touch.</td>', 'interesting shot. I like the lighting here and the fishnet is a nice touch.', '2007-02-04 16:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326494, 460137, 56658, '<td valign="top">not really a fan of the high key look here.</td>', 'not really a fan of the high key look here.', '2007-02-04 16:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326511, 460210, 56658, '<td valign="top">not a bad idea but the top of the glass is hard to make out which makes the bottom of it look weird. could be sharper.</td>', 'not a bad idea but the top of the glass is hard to make out which makes the bottom of it look weird. could be sharper.', '2007-02-04 16:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326534, 458943, 69102, '<td valign="top">Composition and pose don''t work for me. Also the blown out highlight on the guitar is very distracting, and the selective coloring (de-coloring?) doesn''t improve the shot either.</td>', 'Composition and pose don''t work for me. Also the blown out highlight on the guitar is very distracting, and the selective coloring (de-coloring?) doesn''t improve the shot either.', '2007-02-04 16:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326536, 456905, 69102, '<td valign="top">Hmm... not sure what you are going for here, but it doesn''t work for me. Focus is odd with the shallow dof and the focus placement at the calves. Also the composition is very strange -- eye starts at the out of focus feet and then is pulled up the legs and away from what I perceive to be your intended point of interest. The toning isn''t warming, so much as jaundiced.</td>', 'Hmm... not sure what you are going for here, but it doesn''t work for me. Focus is odd with the shallow dof and the focus placement at the calves. Also the composition is very strange -- eye starts at the out of focus feet and then is pulled up the legs and away from what I perceive to be your intended point of interest. The toning isn''t warming, so much as jaundiced.', '2007-02-04 16:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326540, 459808, 69102, '<td valign="top">Funny shot, but not really a nude.</td>', 'Funny shot, but not really a nude.', '2007-02-04 16:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326553, 458943, 56658, '<td valign="top">the glare is very distracting and you have some masking problems on you selective desat. sometimes it can be easier to selectively desat using the hue saturation option.</td>', 'the glare is very distracting and you have some masking problems on you selective desat. sometimes it can be easier to selectively desat using the hue saturation option.', '2007-02-04 16:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326555, 460235, 56658, '<td valign="top">not a fan of your processing here. I know this is the type of thing you like jsut wanted to let you know why i was giving you a 4</td>', 'not a fan of your processing here. I know this is the type of thing you like jsut wanted to let you know why i was giving you a 4', '2007-02-04 16:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326557, 459520, 69102, '<td valign="top">Lighting and exposure is very poor. The shadow below the breast doesn''t add anything for me, and even if you wanted the line of the shadow as a compositional element it''s use is too heavy-handed for my taste. Beyond the technical problems, the composition needs a lot of work as well. Perhaps if you had shot this from a less direct angle. I can''t help but think that there are much more subtle and artistic ways to make the point.</td>', 'Lighting and exposure is very poor. The shadow below the breast doesn''t add anything for me, and even if you wanted the line of the shadow as a compositional element it''s use is too heavy-handed for my taste. Beyond the technical problems, the composition needs a lot of work as well. Perhaps if you had shot this from a less direct angle. I can''t help but think that there are much more subtle and artistic ways to make the point.', '2007-02-04 16:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326558, 458762, 69102, '<td valign="top">Lighting is too harsh, and the background is really distracting.</td>', 'Lighting is too harsh, and the background is really distracting.', '2007-02-04 16:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326559, 460350, 69102, '<td valign="top">This would have been much more interesting as a close shot.</td>', 'This would have been much more interesting as a close shot.', '2007-02-04 16:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326560, 460107, 69102, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. But the execution needs work. The doorframe detracts and you could use more light on the lower body, or less light on the upper body.</td>', 'Interesting idea. But the execution needs work. The doorframe detracts and you could use more light on the lower body, or less light on the upper body.', '2007-02-04 16:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326561, 460235, 69102, '<td valign="top">This could be really interesting, but the post processing ruins the shot for me.</td>', 'This could be really interesting, but the post processing ruins the shot for me.', '2007-02-04 16:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326563, 460456, 56658, '<td valign="top">the crop is very good to give the feeling of being trapped. not sure i am getting that from the face though.</td>', 'the crop is very good to give the feeling of being trapped. not sure i am getting that from the face though.', '2007-02-04 16:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326569, 459326, 56658, '<td valign="top">i like the use of a natural looking model, the pose is fine for me but i don''t really like the high keyness of it. i would prefer more contrast</td>', 'i like the use of a natural looking model, the pose is fine for me but i don''t really like the high keyness of it. i would prefer more contrast', '2007-02-04 16:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326574, 460460, 56658, '<td valign="top">i like the idea of it and the fact that you can''t tell it is a nude person is nice but i am not so sure it is good for this challenge.</td>', 'i like the idea of it and the fact that you can''t tell it is a nude person is nice but i am not so sure it is good for this challenge.', '2007-02-04 16:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326578, 459893, 56658, '<td valign="top">i think i like the processing but am not so sure about the cloth.</td>', 'i think i like the processing but am not so sure about the cloth.', '2007-02-04 16:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326581, 460459, 69102, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting take on the challenge, and an interesting and well-composed image. I have a feeling that this is either going to score very well, or very poorly (or land squarely in the middle because people are equally scoring it sharply in either direction. In the end I''ve decided to give this a 5, simply because I think that in choosing this shot, which has it''s own technical difficulties I''m sure, it avoids the technical challenges that generally come with shooting nudes.</td>', 'This is an interesting take on the challenge, and an interesting and well-composed image. I have a feeling that this is either going to score very well, or very poorly (or land squarely in the middle because people are equally scoring it sharply in either direction. In the end I''ve decided to give this a 5, simply because I think that in choosing this shot, which has it''s own technical difficulties I''m sure, it avoids the technical challenges that generally come with shooting nudes.', '2007-02-04 16:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326614, 460036, 69102, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea, but the post processing (which I think you were trying to use to get an old tintype feel), doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Not a bad idea, but the post processing (which I think you were trying to use to get an old tintype feel), doesn''t work for me.', '2007-02-04 16:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326618, 460366, 69102, '<td valign="top">Exposure is extremely muddy on my monitor.</td>', 'Exposure is extremely muddy on my monitor.', '2007-02-04 16:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326625, 456848, 69102, '<td valign="top">Don''t know that the underwear selected really says "bride." This is generally a little too overexposed for me (even understanding that you were going for a high key look).</td>', 'Don''t know that the underwear selected really says "bride." This is generally a little too overexposed for me (even understanding that you were going for a high key look).', '2007-02-04 16:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326631, 460102, 69102, '<td valign="top">The pose does less to emphasize the tattoo than it does to make the model look abnormally hunched.</td>', 'The pose does less to emphasize the tattoo than it does to make the model look abnormally hunched.', '2007-02-04 16:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326633, 460140, 69102, '<td valign="top">Either the lighting or the post processing is coming across very harsh here. Combined with the model''s expression and the other compositional elements, this doesn''t evoke pleasure to me at all. So (unless you''re being ironic) I think you missed your intended mark. The model''s skin looks mottled, perhaps even diseased on my monitor, and the angle evokes a "skewed" or disoriented mental state.</td>', 'Either the lighting or the post processing is coming across very harsh here. Combined with the model''s expression and the other compositional elements, this doesn''t evoke pleasure to me at all. So (unless you''re being ironic) I think you missed your intended mark. The model''s skin looks mottled, perhaps even diseased on my monitor, and the angle evokes a "skewed" or disoriented mental state.', '2007-02-04 16:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326637, 459826, 69102, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but not technically a nude.</td>', 'Interesting, but not technically a nude.', '2007-02-04 16:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326649, 460260, 69102, '<td valign="top">On a second review, I''m bumping this to an 8. This very creative and emotive work. I actually think that pulling out just a bit and adding touch more light on the model from the front (just enough so that more detail comes out and so that we can see her expression without straining) might have produced a fantastic shot.</td>', 'On a second review, I''m bumping this to an 8. This very creative and emotive work. I actually think that pulling out just a bit and adding touch more light on the model from the front (just enough so that more detail comes out and so that we can see her expression without straining) might have produced a fantastic shot.', '2007-02-04 16:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326658, 460138, 69102, '<td valign="top">Too small; poor focus and composition.</td>', 'Too small; poor focus and composition.', '2007-02-04 17:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326672, 460480, 23318, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. I may steal this idea in the future. I think the only improvements would be her hand placement looks slightly unnatural, and the flower seems a bit physically flattened.</td>', 'Lovely shot. I may steal this idea in the future. I think the only improvements would be her hand placement looks slightly unnatural, and the flower seems a bit physically flattened.', '2007-02-04 17:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326678, 458330, 23318, '<td valign="top">lovely profile. the lighting is beautiful, and highligts the curves very well, without losing the depth of the shadows. Good luck.</td>', 'lovely profile. the lighting is beautiful, and highligts the curves very well, without losing the depth of the shadows. Good luck.', '2007-02-04 17:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326684, 459800, 23318, '<td valign="top">great idea, the lines along her body, and across her face are a bit distracting . I hope to see this high in the voting.</td>', 'great idea, the lines along her body, and across her face are a bit distracting . I hope to see this high in the voting.', '2007-02-04 17:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326690, 460104, 23318, '<td valign="top">This is a very lovely shot, that shows great detail. The lighting is beautiful, and gives off a very shy feeling. Good Luck.</td>', 'This is a very lovely shot, that shows great detail. The lighting is beautiful, and gives off a very shy feeling. Good Luck.', '2007-02-04 17:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326695, 460136, 23318, '<td valign="top">very well done shot. While I personally think this would have been a better picture with the face showing. The arms feel very unnatural. I do think it''s a very lovely shot however and rated it very well. Good luck</td>', 'very well done shot. While I personally think this would have been a better picture with the face showing. The arms feel very unnatural. I do think it''s a very lovely shot however and rated it very well. Good luck', '2007-02-04 17:11:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3326696, 460364, 56658, '<td valign="top">i like the concept. i wish the background was smooth</td>', 'i like the concept. i wish the background was smooth', '2007-02-04 17:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326697, 460132, 56658, '<td valign="top">i think my monitor is a bit bright but i wish i couldn''t see the wrinkles inthe background.</td>', 'i think my monitor is a bit bright but i wish i couldn''t see the wrinkles inthe background.', '2007-02-04 17:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326698, 459628, 56658, '<td valign="top">seems to either have allot of noise or some weird processing going on.</td>', 'seems to either have allot of noise or some weird processing going on.', '2007-02-04 17:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326706, 460350, 23318, '<td valign="top">I don''t mind the subject matter, but I feel it''s such a small portion of the image, that it''s causing the subject to be non-apparent.</td>', 'I don''t mind the subject matter, but I feel it''s such a small portion of the image, that it''s causing the subject to be non-apparent.', '2007-02-04 17:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326714, 460036, 23318, '<td valign="top">Very good recreateion of a classic image/feel. However I don''t like the crackle treatment done to the image, and feel that the whole thing is overly hazy.</td>', 'Very good recreateion of a classic image/feel. However I don''t like the crackle treatment done to the image, and feel that the whole thing is overly hazy.', '2007-02-04 17:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326744, 460122, 23318, '<td valign="top">I feel the driftwood adds some charachter to the shot, but it has become the subject, as opposed to the model being the subject. I also think that the arm placement and shadow above and below the lower arm is distracting. I think the contrast may be a bit much for me as well.</td>', 'I feel the driftwood adds some charachter to the shot, but it has become the subject, as opposed to the model being the subject. I also think that the arm placement and shadow above and below the lower arm is distracting. I think the contrast may be a bit much for me as well.', '2007-02-04 17:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326768, 459469, 23318, '<td valign="top">I''m just not sure the point on this one. The lighting is good, but the pose just doens''t work for me, reguardless of the intent. I think it''s because I don''t feel that this person is being repressed. Good luck with the voters, I hope I''m wrong...</td>', 'I''m just not sure the point on this one. The lighting is good, but the pose just doens''t work for me, reguardless of the intent. I think it''s because I don''t feel that this person is being repressed. Good luck with the voters, I hope I''m wrong...', '2007-02-04 17:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326779, 459504, 23318, '<td valign="top">I like the pose, and it highlights the lovely butterfly tattoo on her shoulder. The facial expression is a bit odd, and feel that the depth of field is a bit wrong. I also do not like the selective coloration of the eyes, intentional or not, it''s just feeling slightly unnatural, and even disturbing.</td>', 'I like the pose, and it highlights the lovely butterfly tattoo on her shoulder. The facial expression is a bit odd, and feel that the depth of field is a bit wrong. I also do not like the selective coloration of the eyes, intentional or not, it''s just feeling slightly unnatural, and even disturbing.', '2007-02-04 17:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326781, 460267, 23318, '<td valign="top">There''s no detail in this image, I don''t know what I''m looking at, nor am I interested in what IS being shown. Good luck.</td>', 'There''s no detail in this image, I don''t know what I''m looking at, nor am I interested in what IS being shown. Good luck.', '2007-02-04 17:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326796, 459332, 23318, '<td valign="top">I feel that the noise and the blue hue of this shot work for it, but feel that it may be a bit too much. I also think that the "jewel" is balanced a bit oddly  on her, making it seem either VERY uncomfortable, or not intending to be there. <br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'I feel that the noise and the blue hue of this shot work for it, but feel that it may be a bit too much. I also think that the "jewel" is balanced a bit oddly  on her, making it seem either VERY uncomfortable, or not intending to be there.  Good luck', '2007-02-04 17:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326807, 460341, 36619, '<td valign="top">very artistic, has a romantic dreamy quality that is sweet.</td>', 'very artistic, has a romantic dreamy quality that is sweet.', '2007-02-04 17:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326812, 460456, 23318, '<td valign="top">Great use of the edge of the frame as a box, however I don''t feel any depth to the image. I also think that the desat makes it feel even more flat and lacking of depth.</td>', 'Great use of the edge of the frame as a box, however I don''t feel any depth to the image. I also think that the desat makes it feel even more flat and lacking of depth.', '2007-02-04 17:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326817, 460380, 36619, '<td valign="top">love the pierced lemon, great touch to this artistic image!</td>', 'love the pierced lemon, great touch to this artistic image!', '2007-02-04 17:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326819, 459559, 36619, '<td valign="top">love the lighting, gives this a great dramatic quality.</td>', 'love the lighting, gives this a great dramatic quality.', '2007-02-04 17:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326827, 460423, 23318, '<td valign="top">The color shift, and severe editing of this image just turn me off of this image. I think it''s very origional, but it just doesn''t quite add up for me personally. Model is beautiful, and the shadows add curiosity. I''d like to see the origional capture to see where it started from. Good luck.</td>', 'The color shift, and severe editing of this image just turn me off of this image. I think it''s very origional, but it just doesn''t quite add up for me personally. Model is beautiful, and the shadows add curiosity. I''d like to see the origional capture to see where it started from. Good luck.', '2007-02-04 17:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326834, 460107, 23318, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the post processing on this, the added haze doens''t quite work for me. I think that''s the greatest issue with the image. Good luck</td>', 'I don''t like the post processing on this, the added haze doens''t quite work for me. I think that''s the greatest issue with the image. Good luck', '2007-02-04 17:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326855, 460473, 23318, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, I love the triangles. I might have lowered the tips of the thumbs  down onto her nose to create two additional obvious triangles in the image. I may have also narrowed the stance to elbow width to get a bit less negative space from the elbows. However the image is quite lovely, and hope it does really really well. Good luck.</td>', 'Lovely image, I love the triangles. I might have lowered the tips of the thumbs  down onto her nose to create two additional obvious triangles in the image. I may have also narrowed the stance to elbow width to get a bit less negative space from the elbows. However the image is quite lovely, and hope it does really really well. Good luck.', '2007-02-04 17:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326862, 459780, 23318, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best and most accurate emotive images in the challenge. I actually feel that he feels isolated. The lighting is wonderful. Good Luck</td>', 'This is one of the best and most accurate emotive images in the challenge. I actually feel that he feels isolated. The lighting is wonderful. Good Luck', '2007-02-04 17:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326879, 460478, 23318, '<td valign="top">Great idea. I really like the lighting. I''d really like to see an explination on how this was captured. Other than that, I cannot think of any suggestions to improve my already high score. Good luck.</td>', 'Great idea. I really like the lighting. I''d really like to see an explination on how this was captured. Other than that, I cannot think of any suggestions to improve my already high score. Good luck.', '2007-02-04 17:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326883, 460474, 23318, '<td valign="top">Very soft, and comforting pose, along with the higher contrast of the stones along her back, The curve of her skin on the table/bed is also nice. The hair looks doctored, but I''ll take the benifit of the doubt. The only improvement I can list, is the whole image looks desaturated. It''s just missing a little bit of punch that I think would make the image better. Good luck.</td>', 'Very soft, and comforting pose, along with the higher contrast of the stones along her back, The curve of her skin on the table/bed is also nice. The hair looks doctored, but I''ll take the benifit of the doubt. The only improvement I can list, is the whole image looks desaturated. It''s just missing a little bit of punch that I think would make the image better. Good luck.', '2007-02-04 17:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326892, 460469, 23318, '<td valign="top">While I feel this is an image shoe-horned in, I also feel it''s a very great PJ shot. The detail in the henna painting is wonderful, and the artist did a great job on it as well. <br/> <br/>If you''d cropped in a bit tighter on just the hand and the image, and eliminated the slight glare on the henna itself, it may have improved your overall score, and decrease the "shoe horn" feeling of the shot</td>', 'While I feel this is an image shoe-horned in, I also feel it''s a very great PJ shot. The detail in the henna painting is wonderful, and the artist did a great job on it as well.  If you''d cropped in a bit tighter on just the hand and the image, and eliminated the slight glare on the henna itself, it may have improved your overall score, and decrease the "shoe horn" feeling of the shot', '2007-02-04 17:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3326940, 459874, 27735, '<td valign="top">Ben Harper, right?</td>', 'Ben Harper, right?', '2007-02-04 18:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3327086, 460366, 18765, '<td valign="top">where''s the contrast?</td>', 'where''s the contrast?', '2007-02-04 18:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3327125, 460039, 45919, '<td valign="top">Excellent angle, something different!</td>', 'Excellent angle, something different!', '2007-02-04 19:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3327127, 460188, 45919, '<td valign="top">I love the use of colour and monochrome, well done.</td>', 'I love the use of colour and monochrome, well done.', '2007-02-04 19:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3327132, 459764, 45919, '<td valign="top">That''s a really interesting and tasteful way of presenting your subject, well done, really nice.</td>', 'That''s a really interesting and tasteful way of presenting your subject, well done, really nice.', '2007-02-04 19:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3327135, 460138, 45919, '<td valign="top">Too small to be effective...  In my view, would have better had you not have cropped so small.</td>', 'Too small to be effective...  In my view, would have better had you not have cropped so small.', '2007-02-04 19:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
