(3329635, 459871, 40819, '<td valign="top">Wow this is the second highest image I have ever entered in a challenge. Thanks so much for your support and comments.<br/> <br/>I wanted to tell you all I think I learned something here. Jessica and I were shooting with another photographer and he and I were sharing the strobes. At this shot I had my 50-200mm lens on and boosted my ISO to 400 since it wasn''t my turn to use the strobes. The light source is from the modeling lights in the background.<br/> <br/>After reading some of the comments I thought to myself I should not have converted it to B&amp;W. So I figured I would upload the color and you can tell me if you think it is better.<br/> <br/>As you can see the questions as to the placement of the body are answered in the original with her hands on her hips and the entire body perfectly centered in the frame. I liked the Crescent in the title because it reminded me of how the moon looks as a crescent in the sky, sometimes it almost looks like you can see the dark side of the moon.<br/> <br/>Just thinking out loud. Here is the original.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=464185" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40819/thumb/464185.jpg?1'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40819/thumb/464185.jpg?1'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40819/thumb/464185.jpg?1"/></a></td>', 'Wow this is the second highest image I have ever entered in a challenge. Thanks so much for your support and comments. I wanted to tell you all I think I learned something here. Jessica and I were shooting with another photographer and he and I were sharing the strobes. At this shot I had my 50-200mm lens on and boosted my ISO to 400 since it wasn''t my turn to use the strobes. The light source is from the modeling lights in the background. After reading some of the comments I thought to myself I should not have converted it to B&W. So I figured I would upload the color and you can tell me if you think it is better. As you can see the questions as to the placement of the body are answered in the original with her hands on her hips and the entire body perfectly centered in the frame. I liked the Crescent in the title because it reminded me of how the moon looks as a crescent in the sky, sometimes it almost looks like you can see the dark side of the moon. Just thinking out loud. Here is the original. ', '2007-02-05 08:07:52.000000', NULL, 0),
