(3331816, 458769, 26756, '<td valign="top">Pedro, I''m going to have to be the odd man out here.  I love your photography a lot because you capture so much emotion and personality in the people you photograph.  This one to me, while technically fantastic, looked like an appeal to Joe Six-Pack.<br/> <br/>I mean, the lighting, colors, etc are fantastic.  Technically you couldn''t have done a better job. But to me it doesn''t come close to having the soul or artistic feel your shots usually have.  This looks like a shot for the Maxim or a men''s calendar or something like that. I hate to be the lonely voice that wasn''t thrilled with the photo, but I figured I''d give you my opinion anyway.</td>', 'Pedro, I''m going to have to be the odd man out here.  I love your photography a lot because you capture so much emotion and personality in the people you photograph.  This one to me, while technically fantastic, looked like an appeal to Joe Six-Pack. I mean, the lighting, colors, etc are fantastic.  Technically you couldn''t have done a better job. But to me it doesn''t come close to having the soul or artistic feel your shots usually have.  This looks like a shot for the Maxim or a men''s calendar or something like that. I hate to be the lonely voice that wasn''t thrilled with the photo, but I figured I''d give you my opinion anyway.', '2007-02-05 16:53:49.000000', NULL, 0),
