(3334061, 460157, 24073, '<td valign="top">Yes I agree this should have finished stronger.  Its soft, clear, and the lighting is terrific.  I also see a hint of classic nudity, (my personal favorites).  I''m not a huge fan of this new school nude photography, nor am I a fan of the top three photos in this challenge.  In my opinion, you nailed a unique shot by ironically going classic.  I can''t say enough about this image, so I better stop.  Great job.</td>', 'Yes I agree this should have finished stronger.  Its soft, clear, and the lighting is terrific.  I also see a hint of classic nudity, (my personal favorites).  I''m not a huge fan of this new school nude photography, nor am I a fan of the top three photos in this challenge.  In my opinion, you nailed a unique shot by ironically going classic.  I can''t say enough about this image, so I better stop.  Great job.', '2007-02-06 08:58:29.000000', NULL, 0),
