(3350317, 460159, 41802, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>"Bear" Naked is a great entry into the Nude IV challenge.  I think you did an excellent job of keeping the image tasteful and fun.  <br/> <br/>Overall the image is very pleasing, I think black and white was an excellent choice.  The coloring (or lack of color) allows the image to stay simple and clean, nothing too distracting.  The composition is very nice. I really like that you included the banister, instead of just having your model floating out in space.  I wonder if based on leaving the banister in you were using natural light from a door way.  The reason I mention the lighting is it is a bit strong and caused a little bit of a blow out on the bears face.  I think overall this probably changed the score, for my self personally it only changed the score by a point. I am sure others would have voted higher based on a softer lighting.<br/> <br/>I think this was a wonderful entry and hopefully your model would agree and let you continue to enter the challenges because you defiantly have a creative eye.  Also I just have to say for your first nude this is an excellent job! I think being able to photograph nudes is one of the hardest challenges. <br/></td>', '*Critique Club* "Bear" Naked is a great entry into the Nude IV challenge.  I think you did an excellent job of keeping the image tasteful and fun.   Overall the image is very pleasing, I think black and white was an excellent choice.  The coloring (or lack of color) allows the image to stay simple and clean, nothing too distracting.  The composition is very nice. I really like that you included the banister, instead of just having your model floating out in space.  I wonder if based on leaving the banister in you were using natural light from a door way.  The reason I mention the lighting is it is a bit strong and caused a little bit of a blow out on the bears face.  I think overall this probably changed the score, for my self personally it only changed the score by a point. I am sure others would have voted higher based on a softer lighting. I think this was a wonderful entry and hopefully your model would agree and let you continue to enter the challenges because you defiantly have a creative eye.  Also I just have to say for your first nude this is an excellent job! I think being able to photograph nudes is one of the hardest challenges. ', '2007-02-10 10:21:14.000000', NULL, 0),
