(3351596, 460338, 41802, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>I think this image is one that demands attention, whether voters like it or not you have to stop and look.  I personally liked the image because it really grabbed my attention and it was differnt.  Also after reading your comments I can''t believe he is so tall! <br/> <br/>This was an awesome idea and you did a wonderful job of capturing it.  I think your depth of field was just right for me because if the image was to sharp I think it would have distracted from the lines that were created.  Your lighting and color both look great.  I also like the composition, if this were any other shot I probably like to have seen the top of his head but the cropping really works well here.  <br/> <br/>Overall this is an excellent piece, I am surprised it didn''t score higher because you know as everyone was flipping through and voting this one had to grab their attention. Keep up the great work I look forward to your future entries!  <br/></td>', '*Critique Club* I think this image is one that demands attention, whether voters like it or not you have to stop and look.  I personally liked the image because it really grabbed my attention and it was differnt.  Also after reading your comments I can''t believe he is so tall!  This was an awesome idea and you did a wonderful job of capturing it.  I think your depth of field was just right for me because if the image was to sharp I think it would have distracted from the lines that were created.  Your lighting and color both look great.  I also like the composition, if this were any other shot I probably like to have seen the top of his head but the cropping really works well here.   Overall this is an excellent piece, I am surprised it didn''t score higher because you know as everyone was flipping through and voting this one had to grab their attention. Keep up the great work I look forward to your future entries!  ', '2007-02-10 20:22:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3351610, 459893, 41802, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>Wow even before I looked at your title I said vintage to myself, excellent job capturing one word.  I think it is a great talent to be able to create something that so clearly define on adjective. <br/> <br/>This is a very striking piece and very well composed.  I think people try so hard to come up all kids of crazy ideas when you were able to come up with a pretty simple concept and be the only one to shot something like this, and do a great job. <br/> <br/>The lighting is prefect and does not create and harsh lines.  Also the coloring is great I think you have found the prefect tint for this piece.  Overall this is a very wonderful piece. I look forward to your future challenges. <br/></td>', '*Critique Club* Wow even before I looked at your title I said vintage to myself, excellent job capturing one word.  I think it is a great talent to be able to create something that so clearly define on adjective.  This is a very striking piece and very well composed.  I think people try so hard to come up all kids of crazy ideas when you were able to come up with a pretty simple concept and be the only one to shot something like this, and do a great job.  The lighting is prefect and does not create and harsh lines.  Also the coloring is great I think you have found the prefect tint for this piece.  Overall this is a very wonderful piece. I look forward to your future challenges. ', '2007-02-10 20:28:08.000000', NULL, 0),
