(3528715, 460153, 54885, '<td valign="top">I wanted to add this comment after reading your comment that you made underneath your photo....My laptop has a brighter view than my stationary pc-I don''t really notice the cloth around the male model''s hoo hoo and ha ha''s. I love the crop because it brings the focus in on the overall pose. My favorite feature about this photo is the excellent lighting that shows on the female model and the soft lighting showing on the male model. The overall picture quality, on all my computers that I have used to look at this photo, is just truly awesome and mind blowing!! Now that is just my opinion</td>', 'I wanted to add this comment after reading your comment that you made underneath your photo....My laptop has a brighter view than my stationary pc-I don''t really notice the cloth around the male model''s hoo hoo and ha ha''s. I love the crop because it brings the focus in on the overall pose. My favorite feature about this photo is the excellent lighting that shows on the female model and the soft lighting showing on the male model. The overall picture quality, on all my computers that I have used to look at this photo, is just truly awesome and mind blowing!! Now that is just my opinion', '2007-04-07 22:53:22.000000', NULL, 0),
