(4644134, 460157, 39218, '<td valign="top">I love the way the model is posed, so 40''s like, so open to being photographed in such an exposed way.  She is either extremely comfortable in her own skin or she trusts you absolutely implicitly.  Posing in such a way is extremely difficult to do and have the effect as beautiful as this.  Even the way the fabric is draped feels completely natural and totally unstaged.  Her face is lit perfectly, her chest is awesomely lit (despite what other people have said) and the entire composition is stunning... almost to the point of being like an alabaster statue.  <br/> <br/>I''ll bet she was very pleased with the outcome.  Thank you for sharing this.</td>', 'I love the way the model is posed, so 40''s like, so open to being photographed in such an exposed way.  She is either extremely comfortable in her own skin or she trusts you absolutely implicitly.  Posing in such a way is extremely difficult to do and have the effect as beautiful as this.  Even the way the fabric is draped feels completely natural and totally unstaged.  Her face is lit perfectly, her chest is awesomely lit (despite what other people have said) and the entire composition is stunning... almost to the point of being like an alabaster statue.   I''ll bet she was very pleased with the outcome.  Thank you for sharing this.', '2008-04-16 15:37:26.000000', NULL, 0),
